{"abstract":"Det er udtryk for mangel på faglighed og forståelse for samfundsrelevans, at det nye Museum VEST for nyligt har meddelt, at landets sidste forskningsinstitution i besættelsen skal lukkes. Desuden kappes båndene til landets eneste Holocaustcenter. Der er tale om et nationalt videnstab.","author_count":17,"contributors":["Kjeldbæk, Esben","Andersen, Steen","Bak, Sofie Lene","Scavenius Bertelsen, Gry","Tarabini, Silvia Goldbaum","Bundgård Christensen, Claus","Hansen, Peer Henrik","Larsen, Dennis","Lund, Joachim","Rostgaard Nissen, Mogens","Rasmussen, René","Wium Olesen, Niels","Gram-Skjoldager, Karen","Sørensen, Jakob","Warring, Anette"],"cuid":["S02-094.33-751822"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Dansk Centralbibliotek for Sydslesvig","Dansk Centralbibliotek for Sydslesvig e.V."],"level":"pop","mra":["hum","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"],"OT":["Frihedsmuseet"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-KUM","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"anden verdenskrig helt forkert at stoppe forskning i besættelsestiden og kappe båndene til holocaustcenter","src":["cbs","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://avisendanmark.dk/debat/kronik-helt-forkert-at-stoppe-forskning-i-besaettelsestiden","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-094.33-751822","ids":["cbs-dd1dc104-7571-4a9e-abac-77a156c805b6","ruc-e69ebc4e-2007-40db-bfa3-621d1bcf94e7"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities","Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-3EAC0259580CA2A4F4D7F4FC8EAAD9AB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type"