"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Dennis","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Joachim","key":"lundpau","last":"Lund","locid":"1c147dab-c7a7-4886-b491-3a6d19693add","name":"Lund, Joachim","orcid":"0000-0001-7406-8903","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Mogens","key":"rostgaardnissenpau","last":"Rostgaard Nissen","name":"Rostgaard Nissen, Mogens","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7","first":"Mogens Rostgaard","key":"nissenpau","last":"Nissen","name":"Nissen, Mogens Rostgaard","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, René","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"8","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels","key":"wiumolesenpau","last":"Wium Olesen","name":"Wium Olesen, Niels","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"8","corresponding":null,"first":"Karen","key":"gramskjoldagerpau","last":"Gram-Skjoldager","name":"Gram-Skjoldager, Karen","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jakob","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Jakob","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","first":"Anette Elisabeth","key":"warringpau","last":"Warring","locid":"51ef9d2b-f112-4a35-a2b5-cd9ff8f485b4","name":"Warring, Anette Elisabeth","orcid":"0000-0002-8243-9927","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"newspaper":"Avisen Danmark","pages":"14","publisher":"Jysk Fynske Medier AS","publisher_org":"Jysk Fynske Medier A/S","status":"p","title":"Avisen Danmark"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Roskilde University","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-dd1dc104-7571-4a9e-abac-77a156c805b6","ruc-e69ebc4e-2007-40db-bfa3-621d1bcf94e7"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Anden verdenskrig : Helt forkert at stoppe forskning i besættelsestiden og kappe båndene til Holocaustcenter","type":"Newspaper Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-094.33-751822","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Horses revolutionized human history with fast mobility1. However, the timeline between their domestication and widespread integration as a means of transportation remains contentious2–4. Here we assemble a large collection of 475 ancient horse genomes to assess the period when these animals were first reshaped by human agency in Eurasia. We find that reproductive control of the modern domestic lineage emerged textasciitilde2,200 BCE (Before Common Era), through close kin mating and shortened generation times. Reproductive control emerged following a severe domestication bottleneck starting no earlier than textasciitilde2,700 BCE, and coincided with a sudden expansion across Eurasia that ultimately resulted in the replacement of nearly every local horse lineage. This expansion marked the rise of widespread horse-based mobility in human history, which refutes the commonly-held narrative of large horse herds accompanying the massive migration of steppe peoples across Europe textasciitilde3,000 BCE and earlier3,5. Finally, we detect significantly shortened generation times at Botai textasciitilde3,500 BCE, a settlement from Central Asia associated with corrals and a subsistence economy centered on horses6,7. This supports local horse husbandry before the rise of modern domestic bloodlines.","author_count":147,"contributors":["Librado, Pablo","Tressières, Gaetan","Chauvey, Lorelei","Fages, Antoine","Khan, Naveed","Schiavinato, Stéphanie","Calvière-Tonasso, Laure","Kusliy, Mariya A.","Gaunitz, Charleen","Liu, Xuexue","Wagner, Stefanie","Der Sarkissian, Clio","Seguin-Orlando, Andaine","Perdereau, Aude","Aury, Jean-Marc","Southon, John","Shapiro, Beth","Bouchez, Olivier","Donnadieu, Cécile","Collin, Yvette Running Horse","Gregersen, Kristian Murphy","Jessen, Mads Dengsø","Christensen, Kirsten","Claudi-Hansen, Lone","Pruvost, Mélanie","Pucher, Erich","Vulic, Hrvoje","Novak, Mario","Rimpf, Andrea","Turk, Peter","Reiter, Simone","Brem, Gottfried","Schwall, Christo