{"abstract":"Introduction: The Danish Health Care Registers rely on the International Statistical Classification of Diseases and Related Health Problems (ICD)-classification and stand as a widely utilized resource for health epidemiological research. Eating disorders are multifaceted syndromes where two distinctive diagnoses are defined, anorexia nervosa (AN) and bulimia nervosa (BN). However, the validity of the registered diagnoses remains to be verified. Manuel chart review is often the method for validation of diagnosis codes, but there is limited research on how natural language processing (NLP) models could enhance this process. Objective: To investigate the accuracy of the clinical use of ICD-10 diagnosis codes F50.0, F50.1, F50.2, and F50.3 in the Danish Health Care Registers, using a manual chart review assisted by NLP. Method: From a cohort of all individuals attending hospitals in Region of Southern Denmark with registered electronic health information, we extracted medical information from the electronic health journal on 100 individuals with each of the four diagnosis codes. After extraction, an NLP model with regular expression search patterns identified relevant text passages for manual chart review. Results: Overall, 372 of the 400 diagnosis codes (93%) were correct. A diagnosis code for AN was correct in 90% of instances, 96% for atypical AN, 96% for BN and 90% for an atypical BN diagnosis code. Conclusion: We found that the accuracy of a diagnosis code F50.0, F50.1, F50.2, and F50.3 to be high. This confirms that the generally well-documented validity of the Danish health care registers also applies to the eating disorder diagnoses.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Egedal, Jeanie Meincke","Støving, René Klinkby","Lynggaard, Rasmus Bank","Laursen, Martin Sundahl","Vinholt, Pernille Just","Hansen, Rasmus Søgaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-766141"],"filters":{"added":"2024-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Egedal, Jeanie Meincke"],"keyword":["Anorexia nervosa","Bulimia nervosa","Diagnosis codes","NLP"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"validation of anorexia nervosa and bulimia nervosa diagnosis coding in danish hospitals assisted by a natural language processing model","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpsychires.2024.09.018","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-766141","identifier":[{"id":"39326221","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85204738317","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-84714c35-3038-424f-b1bd-52cbce6e2f1f"],"keyword":["Anorexia nervosa","Bulimia nervosa","Diagnosis codes","NLP"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8E00ECD29787E3C887F45172EB1067E5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/272892679/1-s2.0-S0022395624005405-main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpsychires.2024.09.018","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Endocrinology (Odense)","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Open - Bandim","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, IRS – Mental Health Services in Region Zealand"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jeanie Meincke","key":"egedalpau","last":"Egedal","locid":"82325e4d-127e-4988-8e9a-2767eed09044","name":"Egedal, Jeanie Meincke","orcid":"0000-0001-9406-5726","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rene Klinkby","key":"støvingpau","last":"Støving","locid":"4aab81f6-352f-4c74-82a2-23589beb9fd5","name":"Støving, René Klinkby","name_org":"Støving, Rene Klinkby","orcid":"0000-0002-4255-5544","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rasmus Bank","key":"lynggaardpau","last":"Lynggaard","locid":"95404ad5-9609-49fc-89ef-f8e357baa931","name":"Lynggaard, Rasmus Bank","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin Sundahl","key":"laursenpau","last":"Laursen","locid":"fdbb1b83-b63b-467f-a74b-652836363f94","name":"Laursen, Martin Sundahl","orcid":"0000-0001-5684-1325","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pernille Just","key":"vinholtpau","last":"Vinholt","locid":"cb41cdaf-9b46-4f58-9b81-210a9f2312b8","name":"Vinholt, Pernille Just","orcid":"0000-0002-2035-0169","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rasmus Søgaard","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"9993f37b-ee9e-4c5d-8c42-cf7cdbecaafb","name":"Hansen, Rasmus Søgaard","orcid":"0000-0002-5588-5489","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["39326221"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jpsychires.2024.09.018","issn":["00223956","18791379"],"issn_org":["00223956"],"journal":"Journal of Psychiatric Research","pages":"266-269","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Journal of Psychiatric Research","volume":"179"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85204738317"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-84714c35-3038-424f-b1bd-52cbce6e2f1f"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Validation of anorexia nervosa and Bulimia nervosa diagnosis coding in Danish hospitals assisted by a natural language processing model","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-766141","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"IoT devices are ubiquitous in modern society. These devices are often constrained by computational power, memory, and energy consumption. DTLS is a protocol that is widely used by IoT devices, including critical industrial IoT systems, as the transport layer for secure and authenticated communication. In this paper we create a formal model of DTLS in Uppaal SMC and show how statistical model checking can be used to analyse, evaluate, and optimise energy consumption for the protocol. In particular we model and analyse different network scenarios, and show how energy consumption is highly dependent on the specific usage scenario. Based on this, we propose and analyse solutions to reduce energy consumption in common scenarios. Finally, we extend our model with an active attacker trying to drain as much energy as possible from the target system by (ab)using DTLS. Analysing and preventing such Denial of Service attacks is essential for critical systems.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Gehlert, Lise Bech","Jørgensen, Malthe Peter Højen","Koch, Christoffer Brejnholm","Møller, Tobias","Rusbjerg, Signe Kirstine","Bøgedal, Tobias Worm","Poulsen, Danny Bøgsted","Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Lux, Daniel"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-771125"],"event":{"end":"2024-09-11","place":"Milan, it","start":"2024-09-09","title":"29th International Conference on Formal Methods for Industrial Critical Systems, FMICS 2024","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Hansen, Rene Rydhof"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"modelling and analysis of dtls power consumption and attacks","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},