,"DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","seluxit a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-d260168f-d7a3-4130-891b-384d5b0cd2b1"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Modelling and Analysis of DTLS : Power Consumption and Attacks","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-771125","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Static program analysis has become an essential tool for developers to find and avoid bugs as well as security vulnerabilities. This is particularly important for applications requiring formal verification, e.g., safety- or security-critical applications.We formalize and prove correct all the components needed to specify and perform static analysis based on the Datalog logic programming language, including the first known Isabelle formalization of stratified Datalog. In addition the existence of least solutions for any stratified Datalog program is established and proven. We demonstrate the usefulness of our formalization by further formalizing the general Bit-Vector Framework and prove correct four classic analyses in this framework.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Schlichtkrull, Anders","Rydhof Hansen, Rene","Nielson, Flemming"],"cuid":["S02-080.87-784860"],"event":{"end":"2024-04-12","place":"Avila, es","start":"2024-04-08","title":"SAC '24: 39th ACM/SIGAPP Symposium on Applied Computing","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2024-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Datalog","Formal methods","Isabelle","Static analysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"isabelle verified correctness of datalog programs for program analysis","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/750685781/Isabelle_verified_Datalog.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S02-080.87-784860","identifier":[{"id":"85197712551","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-78c44488-abda-41e3-b05c-2ce09c4e0258","dtu-ab56745e-33d6-48e6-8f0e-29f7421c1791"],"keyword":["Datalog","Isabelle","Static analysis","formal methods"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-4A5415148B7D7F3869B8ECA1DDEA3562"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/750685781/Isabelle_verified_Datalog.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed, Embedded and Intelligent Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Software Systems Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders","key":"schlichtkrullpau","last":"Schlichtkrull","locid":"cdf4e11f-24a9-490a-afb7-a9680771fece","name":"Schlichtkrull, Anders","orcid":"0000-0001-9212-6150","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","name_org":"Hansen, René Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Flemming","key":"nielsonpau","last":"Nielson","locid":"f63ba194-185f-465d-9b2b-1f6ff489bc3d","name":"Nielson, Flemming","orcid":"0000-0001-7362-6176","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3605098.3636091","eisbn":["9798400702433"],"pages":"1731-1734","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery (ACM)","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 39th ACM/SIGAPP Symposium on Applied Computing, SAC 2024, Avila, Spain, April 8-12, 2024"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85197712551"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-78c44488-abda-41e3-b05c-2ce09c4e0258","dtu-ab56745e-33d6-48e6-8f0e-29f7421c1791"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Isabelle-verified correctness of Datalog programs for program analysis","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-080.87-784860","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Background and aims: Trends in patient selection and use of pharmacotherapy prior to catheter ablation (CA) for supraventricular tachycardia (SVT) are not well described. This study examined temporal trends in patients undergoing first-time CA for regular SVT, including atrioventricular nodal re-entry tachycardia (AVNRT), accessory pathways (APs), and ectopic atrial tachycardia (EAT) on a nationwide scale in Denmark in the period 2001–2018. Methods and results: Using Danish Nationwide registers, 9959 patients treated with first-time CA for SVT between 2001 and 2018 were identified, of which 6023 (61%) received CA for AVNRT, 2829 (28%) for AP, and 1107 (11%) for EAT. Median age was 55, 42, and 55 in the AVNRT, APs, and EAT group, respectively. The number of patients receiving CA increased from 1195 between 2001 and 2003 to 1914 between 2016 and 2018. The percentage of patients with a CHA2DS2-VASc score ≥ 2 increased in all patient groups. The number of patients who underwent CA with no prior use of antiarrhythmic- or rate limiting medicine increased significantly, though prior use of beta-blockers increased for AVNRT patients. Use of verapamil decreased in all three SVT groups (P < 0.05). Use of amiodarone and class 1C antiarrhythmics remained low, with the highest usage among EAT patients. Conclusion: Between 2001 and 2018, CA was increasingly performed in patients with SVT, primarily AVNRT- and EAT patients. The burden of comorbidities increased. Patients undergoing CA without prior antiarrhythmic- or rate-limiting drug therapy increased significantly. Use of beta-blockers increased and remained the most widely used drug. Graphical Abstract: [Figure not available: see fulltext.]","author_count":13,"contributors":["Middelfart, Charlotte","Tønnesen, Jacob","Zörner, Christopher R.","Da Riis-Vestergaard, Lise","Pham, Maria Hang Xuan","Pallisgaard, Jannik Langtved","Ruwald, Martin H.","Rasmussen, Peter Vibe","Johannessen, Arne","Hansen, Jim","Worck, Rene","Gislason, Gunnar","Hansen, Morten Lock"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-742294"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Middelfart, Charlotte"],"keyword":["Adult","Age Factors","Anti Arrhythmia Agents therapeutic use","Antiarrhythmic therapy","Catheter ablation","Comorbidity","Denmark","Female","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Patient characteristics","Registries","Supraventricular tachycardia"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-HJER"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-NP-HJER","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"two decades of svt ablation in denmark a trend towards higher age more comorbidity and less prior use of antiarrhythmic and rate limiting pharmacotherapy a nationwide registry based danish study","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10840-023-01692-9","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-742294","identifier":[{"id":"85180232738","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC11166800","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"38109025","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-3f884dbc-288a-41c6-8382-09ef203aaf61","sdu-9063b884-4516-444e-8dce-a18aedf4e00b"],"keyword":["Adult","Age Factors","Anti-Arrhythmia Agents/therapeutic use","Antiarrhythmic therapy","Catheter ablation","Comorbidity","Denmark","Female","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Patient characteristics","Registries","Supraventricular tachycardia","Tachycardia, Supraventricular/drug therapy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-CF41010AC4885D0FABC9E14334DE3ED4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.d