{"abstract":"In the original published version of this article, a co-author Anne-Marie Tetsche Sweeney was excluded in the authorship however the authors agreed to include her as third author since she made a significance contribution to the study, including a first draft of the manuscript. The authorship section has been updated. The original article has been corrected.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Poggenborg, René Panduro","Madsen, Ole Rintek","Sweeney, Anne Marie Tetsche","Dreyer, Lene","Bukh, Gunhild","Hansen, Annette"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-686707"],"filters":{"added":"2023-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Poggenborg, René Panduro"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"correction to patient controlled outpatient follow up on demand for patients with rheumatoid arthritis a 000000000002 year randomized controlled trial clinical rheumatology 000000002021 000000000040 000000000009 000000003599 000000003604 000000000010 000000001007 s000000010067 000000000021 000000005674 y","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10067-022-06193-0","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-686707","identifier":[{"id":"85129414044","type":"scopus"},{"id":"35511372","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-5e56215e-15b7-4722-8780-cb68f91d57b5"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D0ABE376EA51403C6E9BBEE97C41124E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10067-022-06193-0","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Rheumatology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Medicin og Akut","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René Panduro","key":"poggenborgpau","last":"Poggenborg","name":"Poggenborg, René Panduro","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole Rintek","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","name":"Madsen, Ole Rintek","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne Marie Tetsche","key":"sweeneypau","last":"Sweeney","name":"Sweeney, Anne Marie Tetsche","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene","key":"dreyerpau","last":"Dreyer","locid":"b12f9d3c-1fa5-4513-8002-c9fd87d60d53","name":"Dreyer, Lene","orcid":"0000-0002-5156-2922","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Gunhild","key":"bukhpau","last":"Bukh","name":"Bukh, Gunhild","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Annette","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Annette","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["35511372"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s10067-022-06193-0","issn":["07703198","14349949"],"issn_org":["07703198"],"issue":"8","journal":"Clinical Rheumatology","pages":"2617","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"Clinical Rheumatology","volume":"41"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85129414044"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-5e56215e-15b7-4722-8780-cb68f91d57b5"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Correction to : Patient-controlled outpatient follow-up on demand for patients with rheumatoid arthritis: a 2-year randomized controlled trial (Clinical Rheumatology, (2021), 40, 9, (3599-3604), 10.1007/s10067-021-05674-y)","type":"Journal Comment","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-686707","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Familial clustering of the skin disease primary hyperhidrosis suggests a genetic component to the disease. The human leucocyte antigen (HLA) is implicated in a range of diseases, including many comorbidities to hyperhidrosis. No study has investigated whether the HLA genes are involved in the pathogenesis of hyperhidrosis. We, therefore, compared HLA alleles in individuals with and without hyperhidrosis in this study of 65,000 blood donors. In this retrospective cohort study, we retrieved information on individuals with and without hyperhidrosis using self-reported questionnaires, the Danish National Patient Registry and the Danish National Prescription Registry on participants recruited to the Danish Blood Donor Study between 2010 and 2019. Association tests using logistic regression were conducted for each HLA allele corrected for sex, age, body mass index, smoking and principal components. Overall, 145 of 65,795 (0.2%) participants had hospital diagnosed hyperhidrosis. Similarly, 1,379 of 15,530 (8.9%) participants had moderate-severe self-reported hyperhidrosis, of whom 447 (2.9%) had severe self-reported hyperhidrosis. Altogether 28 participants had both hospital diagnosed and moderate-severe self-reported hyperhidrosis. Severe self-reported hyperhidrosis was associated with HLA-A*80:01 (adjusted odds ratio 26.97; 95% confidence interval 5.32-136.70; n=7; p<0.001). Moderate-severe self-reported hyperhidrosis and hospital diagnosed hyperhidrosis were not associated with any HLA. The association between hyperhidrosis and HLA-A*80:01 was based on a very small number of cases and not replicated in other patient subsets, and therefore likely a chance finding. Thus, this study suggests that genes other than the HLA are involved in the pathogenesis of hyperhidrosis.","author_count":17,"contributors":["Henning, Mattias AS","Hother, Christoffer E.","Banasik, Karina","Ibler, Kristina S.","Ostrowski, Sisse R.","Erikstrup, Christian","Nielsen, Kaspar René","Ullum, Henrik","Hjalgrim, Henrik","Hansen, Thomas F.","Kaspersen, Kathrine A.","Sørensen, Betina Samuelsen","Sækmose, Susanne G.","Jemec, Gregor B. E.","Pedersen, Ole B."],"cuid":["S03-091.85-012162"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["AS Henning, Mattias","Henning, Mattias AS"],"keyword":["Blood Donors","HLA Antigens","Hyperhidrosis"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hyperhidrosis and human leucocyte antigens in the danish blood donor study","src":["aau","au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/320494499/LINI_Scand_J_Immunol_2022_Henning_Hyperhidrosis_and_human_leucocyte_antigens_in_the_Danish_Blood_Donor_Study.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S03-091.85-012162","identifier":[{"id":"000766593100001","type":"wos"},{"id":"35212011","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85125892819","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ffc1e6a4-e1eb-42de-8009-cdd8a09ecfbf","au-55f59ce9-ac7f-48b6-8411-3fa9014e323f","ku-b12b7baa-ec6b-4e09-ada0-5be1ad1d7ed0"],"keyword":["HLA antigens","blood donors","hyperhidrosis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-D6CB2A4A47A4779E66227D0228B674D3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/532531912/Hyperhidrosis_and_human_leucocyte_antigens_in_the_Danish_Blood_Donor_Study.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://c