{"abstract":"Given the emergence of many new movement-based design methods, our work explores the problem of facilitating the activities and sessions that are part of these methods. We look at literature as well as our own experiences with facilitating movement-based design sessions, draw lessons regarding the various important facets of this facilitation, and present first thoughts regarding how to make competencies in that type of facilitation transferable in teaching.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Reidsma, Dennis","Van Delden, Robby W.","Weijdom, Joris P.","Hansen, René Engelhardt","Lekbo, Søren","Andersen, Rasmus Vestergaard","Rasmussen, Lærke Schjødt","Elbæk, Lars"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-607114"],"event":{"acronym":"CHI PLAY","end":"2022-11-05","place":"Bremen, de","start":"2022-11-02","title":"9th ACM SIGCHI Annual Symposium on Computer-Human Interaction in Play, CHI PLAY 2022","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Hansen, René Engelhardt"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Twente"],"keyword":["Facilitation","Movement based design","Teaching design"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"considerations for teaching facilitator roles for movement based design","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85143155446","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This research was supported by the EU Erasmus+ project Method Cards for Movement-based Interaction Design (MeCaMInD), grant number 2020-1-DK01-KA203-075164. We like to thank the other project partners for fruitful discussions, and Nancy Sihmar for her master thesis work in the context of this project providing us with a canvas approach and new points for discussion. We also thank Edwin Dertien for his interest in this project and for sharing insights and intermediate results of his research."],"id":"S01-000.00-607114","identifier":[{"id":"85143155446","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-766bd7ad-b17f-479f-a943-a1627fe582d6"],"keyword":["Facilitation","Movement-based design","Teaching design"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-28D95FB1BC6575607E7AFCBB8EF1DAEE"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"nl","key":"university of twente","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Twente","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics, Research Unit of Psychology of Sport, Excellence and Health"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Dennis","key":"reidsmapau","last":"Reidsma","name":"Reidsma, Dennis","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Robby W.","key":"vandeldenpau","last":"Van Delden","name":"Van Delden, Robby W.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Joris P.","key":"weijdompau","last":"Weijdom","name":"Weijdom, Joris P.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"René Engelhardt","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"2d887e76-ae82-4a8d-962e-5e927394748e","name":"Hansen, René Engelhardt","orcid":"0000-0002-3145-4940","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"aff