","first":"David","key":"anthonydavidpau","last":"Anthony","name":"Anthony, David","rank":158,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Guus J.","key":"kroonenguuspau","last":"Kroonen","locid":"1643864a-5d68-46eb-9281-0dee2a3ead19","name":"Kroonen, Guus","name_org":"Kroonen, Guus J.","orcid":"0000-0002-3708-0476","rank":159,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kristian","key":"kristiansenkristianpau","last":"Kristiansen","name":"Kristiansen, Kristian","rank":160,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Patrick","key":"winckerpatrickpau","last":"Wincker","name":"Wincker, Patrick","rank":161,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Alan","key":"outramalanpau","last":"Outram","name":"Outram, Alan","rank":162,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ludovic","key":"orlandoludovicpau","last":"Orlando","name":"Orlando, Ludovic","rank":163,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["34671162"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1038/s41586-021-04018-9","issn":["00280836","14764687"],"issn_org":["14764687"],"issue":"7882","journal":"Nature","pages":"634-640","status":"p","title":"Nature","volume":"598"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85117498173"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-e9ea9ad7-bb42-488e-a544-6fe1169aad52"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"The origins and spread of domestic horses from the Western Eurasian steppes","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-533151","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Whenever data is communicated outside a security domain there is the risk that it may influence data coming back in a way that is not permitted by the security domain. This may arise when different security domains relate to different parallel processes that exchange information through communication. We provide general definitions of the demands on the communication and sanitisation primitives so as to mitigate the risk. For interesting instantiations of these definitions we provide algorithms for checking that the demands have been met. The development is illustrated by a worked example dealing with the outsourcing of data management to the cloud.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Nielson, Flemming","Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Nielson, Hanne Riis"],"cuid":["S02-092.36-002856"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Nielson, Flemming"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"benign interaction of security domains","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85119696636&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Acknowledgement. The first author was supported in part by the EU H2020-SU-ICT-03-2018 Project No. 830929 CyberSec4Europe (cybersec4europe.eu). The first and second authors were supported in part by the Danish project Security by Design granted by The Danish Industry Foundation. The third author is retired from the Department of Mathematics and Computer Science, Technical University of Denmark, Kgs. Lyngby, Denmark."],"id":"S02-092.36-002856","identifier":[{"id":"85119696636","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-398e9363-5591-42bd-b4fe-cd68bdf734d2","dtu-11e6d445-738c-4e42-8427-b678f60d6d1c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-FD1F11C5F2E32F462B4165B95ACC3F78"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Formal Methods"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed, Embedded and Intelligent Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Flemming","key":"nielsonflemmingpau","last":"Nielson","locid":"f63ba194-185f-465d-9b2b-1f6ff489bc3d","name":"Nielson, Flemming","orcid":"0000-0001-7362-6176","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenrenerydhofpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","name_org":"Hansen, René Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne Riis","key":"nielsonhanneriispau","last":"Nielson","locid":"44a7d08e-b083-4419-a466-8f4392a7112f","name":"Nielson, Hanne Riis","orcid":"0000-0002-2484-5580","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Daniel","key":"doughertydanielpedh","last":"Dougherty","name":"Dougherty, Daniel","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"José","key":"meseguerjosépedh","last":"Meseguer","name":"Meseguer, José","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Sebastian Alexander","key":"mödersheimsebastianalexanderpedh","last":"Mödersheim","name":"Mödersheim, Sebastian Alexander","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Paul","key":"rowepaulpedh","last":"Rowe","name":"Rowe, Paul","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-91631-2_17","eisbn":["9783030916312"],"isbn":["9783030916305"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"312-331","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","subtitle":"Essays Dedicated to Joshua Guttman on the Occasion of his 66.66th Birthday","title":"Protocols, Strands, and Logic"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85119696636"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-398e9363-5591-42bd-b4fe-cd68bdf734d2","dtu-11e6d445-738c-4e42-8427-b678f60d6d1c"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Benign Interaction of Security Domains","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-092.36-002856","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Emerging software-defined networks and programmable dataplanes promise to render communication networks more dependable, overcoming today's manual and error-prone approach to operate networks. Indeed, programmable dataplanes such as P4 provide great opportunities for improving network performance and developing innovative security features, by allowing programmers to reconfigure and tailor switches towards their needs. However, extending programmability to the dataplane also introduces new threat models. In this paper, using a systematic security analysis, we identify a particularly worrisome vulnerability: the automated program compilers which lie at the core of programmable dataplanes. The dataplane compilers introduce a risk of persistent threats which are covert and hard to detect, and may be exploited for large-scale attacks, affecting many devices. Our main contribution is P4Fuzz, a compiler fuzzer to find bugs and vulnerabilities in P4 compilers, in an efficient and automated manner. We discuss the challenges involved in designing such a compiler fuzzer for P4, present our fuzzing and taming algorithms, and report on experiments with our prototype implementation, considering the standard compilers of BMv2, eBPF, and NetFPGA. Our experiments confirm that P4Fuzz is able to generate and test the validity of dozens of P4 programs per minute. Using P4Fuzz, we also successfully found several bugs which have been acknowledged and fixed by the community.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Agape, Andrei Alexandru","Danceanu, Madalin Claudiu","Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Schmid, Stefan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-070399"],"event":{"end":"2021-01-08","place":"Virtual, Online, jp","start":"2021-01-05","title":"22nd International Conference on Distributed Computing and Networking, ICDCN 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Austria"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Vienna"],"keyword":["Software defined networking"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"p000000000004fuzz compiler fuzzer fordependable programmable dataplanes","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85098690073&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Research supported by the Vienna Science and Technology Fund (WWTF) project ICT19-045."],"id":"S01-000.00-070399","identifier":[{"id":"85098690073","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-46433936-d35f-4007-be5f-2ef54fadb211"],"keyword":["fuzzing","p4 compiler","software defined networking"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-AD011C62F4D1E3A0F1C22AAC386BF8AC"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed, Embedded and Intelligent Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"at","key":"university of vienna","loc":["Austria","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Vienna","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andrei Alexandru","key":"agapepau","last":"Agape","locid":"171e320c-7199-445c-bdd5-589e53fe7d9c","name":"Agape, Andrei Alexandru","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Madalin Claudiu","key":"danceanupau","last":"Danceanu","locid":"579bbedf-d6fd-46b9-8894-f95119741752","name":"Danceanu, Madalin Claudiu","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rene Rydhof","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Stefan","key":"schmidpau","last":"Schmid","name":"Schmid, Stefan","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3427796.3427798","eisbn":["9781450389334"],"pages":"16-25","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery (ACM)","status":"p","title":"ICDCN 2021 - Proceedings of the 2021 International Conference on Distributed Computing and Networking"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85098690073"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-46433936-d35f-4007-be5f-2ef54fadb211"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"P4Fuzz : Compiler Fuzzer forDependable Programmable Dataplanes","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-070399","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"This paper proposes Gollector, a novel tool for measuring the domain name space from different vantage points. Whereas such measurements have typically been conducted from a single (or few) vantage point, our proposed solution combines multiple measurements in a single system. Gollector allows us to express the relative difference in the covered domain name space, and the temporal characteristics, as domain name dark matter. We leverage a three-week trace from four vantage points, by applying the tool to three security-related use cases: early domain registration detection, data leakage in a split-horizon situation, and a proposed method for subdomain enumeration. We release the Gollector source code to the research community to support future research in this field.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Hageman, Kaspar David","Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Pedersen, Jens Myrup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-109896"],"event":{"acronym":"NordSec","end":"2021-11-30","place":"Virtual, Online","start":"2021-11-29","title":"26th Nordic Conference on Secure IT Systems, NordSec 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Hageman, Kaspar David"],"keyword":["DNS","Domain names","Measurements","TLS"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"gollector measuring domain name dark matter from different vantage points","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85119851398&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Acknowledgments. This research was carried out under the SecDNS project, funded by Innovation Fund Denmark. We would like to express our gratitude to Finn Büttner and Erwin Lansing for their assistance in collecting our passive DNS datasets."],"id":"S01-000.00-109896","identifier":[{"id":"85119851398","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ce2030e8-11c0-4c0a-a04c-fbe0f3a5df82"],"keyword":["DNS","Domain names","Measurements","TLS"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3BCE1225DA6C6078B027D5DABFA40988"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Center for Communication, Media and Information Technologies","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Cyber Security Group","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Cyber Security Network"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kaspar","key":"hagemanpau","last":"Hageman","locid":"5b87acc9-fddf-4c49-9e20-b46e04fb1a66","name":"Hageman, Kaspar David","name_org":"Hageman, Kaspar","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","name_org":"Hansen, René Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Myrup","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"dc8aaf34-ac43-4d00-8771-5cbdb