,"Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","North Denmark Region","Other Research","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-cc821196-9d15-49a9-81c5-55f1350496d9","au-f74a643b-7d4c-4ddc-af3c-42fcad09ef09","cbs-299a23ae-fbae-4bbe-b431-dff739668ee8","ku-044c477e-c23a-4e0c-ba45-bc36a4d77c00","sdu-9e7f189e-a65a-4312-ad26-9a0017e17c25"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","CBS Copenhagen Business School","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"A Genome-Wide Meta-Analysis Yields 46 New Loci Associating with Biomarkers of Iron Homeostasis","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S05-096.79-009808","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"This paper investigates the potential of using digital certificates for the detection of phishing domains. This i motivated by phishing domains that have started to abuse the (erroneous) trust of the public in browser padloc symbols, and by the large-scale adoption of the Certificate Transparency (CT) framework. This publicl accessible evidence trail of Transport Layer Security (TLS) certificates has made the TLS landscape mor transparent than ever. By comparing samples of phishing, popular benign, and non-popular benign domains we provide insight into the TLS certificates issuance behavior for phishing domains, focusing on the selectio of the certificate authority, the validation level of the certificates, and the phenomenon of certificate sharin among phishing domains. Our results show that phishing domains gravitate to a relatively small selection o certificate authorities, and disproportionally to cPanel, and tend to rely on certificates with a low, and cheap validation level. Additionally, we demonstrate that the vast majority of certificates issued for phishing domain cover more than only phishing domains. These results suggest that a more pro-active role of CAs and puttin more emphasis on certificate revocation can have a crucial impact in the defense against phishing attacks.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Hageman, Kaspar David","Kidmose, Egon","Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Pedersen, Jens Myrup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-069974"],"event":{"end":"2021-07-08","place":"Virtual, Online","start":"2021-07-06","title":"18th International Conference on Security and Cryptography, SECRYPT 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Digital Certificate","Phishing","TLS"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"can a tls certificate be phishy","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5220/0010516600380049","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This research is carried out under the SecDNS project, funded by Innovation Fund Denmark. We thank Cen-sys.io for sharing their CT log data with us, and we are thankful for the APWG for granting us access to their eCX platform."],"id":"S01-000.00-069974","identifier":[{"id":"85111831832","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-44d6226c-add9-4e92-a5cf-c3e5b4d531e9"],"keyword":["Certificate Transparency","Digital Certificate","Phishing","TLS"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-6-E1DB1FEA372A925BD01476BA395AA057"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/475848757/105166.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5220/0010516600380049","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Center for Communication, Media and Information Technologies","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Cyber Security Group","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Cyber Security Network"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kaspar","key":"hagemanpau","last":"Hageman","locid":"5b87acc9-fddf-4c49-9e20-b46e04fb1a66","name":"Hageman, Kaspar David","name_org":"Hageman, Kaspar","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Egon","key":"kidmosepau","last":"Kidmose","locid":"28f677ca-0bd4-4b54-81d6-21dc5ba71e4a","name":"Kidmose, Egon","orcid":"0000-0003-0542-5334","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","name_org":"Hansen, René Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Myrup","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"dc8aaf34-ac43-4d00-8771-5cbdb8096039","name":"Pedersen, Jens Myrup","orcid":"0000-0002-1903-2921","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sabrina De Capitani","key":"divimercatipedh","last":"di Vimercati","name":"di Vimercati, Sabrina De Capitani","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Pierangela","key":"samaratipedh","last":"Samarati","name":"Samarati, Pierangela","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.5220/0010516600380049","eisbn":["9789897585241"],"issn":["21847711"],"pages":"38-49","publisher":"SciTePress","series":"International Conference on Security and Cryptography - SECRYPT - Proceedings","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 18th International Conference on Security and Cryptography, SECRYPT 2021"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85111831832"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-44d6226c-add9-4e92-a5cf-c3e5b4d531e9"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Can a TLS certificate be phishy?","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-069974","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"The Attack Defense Tree framework was developed to facilitate abstract reasoning about security issues of complex systems. As such, a zoo of techniques and extensions have emerged in an attempt to extend the simple Boolean logic of Attack Defense Trees with behavioral properties and quantities. In this paper we expand the modeling power of Attack Defense Trees by introducing a notion of temporal dependencies between attacks, forcing specific ordering of event in successful attacks. Importantly, we introduce a notion of policy for the defender, facilitating a pseudo-active defender, mechanically reacting to the choices of an attacker. To easen the use of Attack Defense Trees we introduce a domain specific language (DSL) and an accompanying tool. The introduction of the DSL facilitates reuse, modularity, collaborative tree construction and separation of logical properties and quantitative/behavioral elements. The usefulness of our framework is exhibited on a small running example, utilizing the policy-notion to implement a reactive Break The Glass policy. We note that all the implemented analysis techniques use well established tools from the formal methods community to produce the given results, relying on non-trivial and automatic translation to and from the target formalisms. Lastly we present our Open Source prototype-tool, capable of conducting various analysis and visualizing the results.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","Legay, Axel","Jensen, Peter Gjøl","Poulsen, Danny Bøgsted"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-087718"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Modelling","Security","UPPAAL"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"adtlang a programming language approach to attack defense trees","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85099096733&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-087718","identifier":[{"id":"85099096733","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-818ec9d4-7f53-4a6b-b531-28a99b13bae0"],"keyword":["Attack-Defense tree","Modelling","Security","UPPAAL"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3B1B6BC4A9CD3CE12CCA1B23C3E5E75B"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed, Embedded and Intelligent Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","name_org":"Hansen, René Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kim Guldstrand","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"27dbc400-17ea-4672-9343-63093ad486c9","name":"Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","orcid":"0000-0002-5953-3384","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Axel Bernard E","key":"legaypau","last":"Legay","locid":"8755f01e-c7cb-443a-bac8-1cfd63ba931c","name":"Legay, Axel","name_org":"Legay, Axel Bernard E","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter Gjøl","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"c4f42663-444e-40ed-a17e-f4e3abb55464","name":"Jensen, Peter Gjøl","orcid":"0000-0002-9320-9991","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Danny Bøgsted","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","locid":"dfb3337d-6acd-49e8-a38c-d819a6efca6c","name":"Poulsen, Danny Bøgsted","orcid":"0000-0001-9623-0748","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s10009-020-00593-w","issn":["14332779","14332787"],"issn_org":["14332779"],"issue":"1","journal":"International Journal on Software Tools for Technology Transfer","pages":"89-104","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"International Journal on Software Tools for Technology Transfer","volume":"23"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85099096733"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-818ec9d4-7f53-4a6b-b531-28a99b13bae0"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"ADTLANG: A Programming Language Approach to Attack Defense Trees","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-087718","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"We present a molecular dynamics study of the low-temperature polymorph of silver closo-borate α-Ag2B12H12, which is a promising ionic conductor. By means of 1H and 11B nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy, we identified two dynamic processes in the system that involve the movements of B12H122- cages: fast rotations with an activation energy of 308 meV and tumbling of the cages at lower temperatures with an activation energy of 67 meV. Fast rotations are known to facilitate the diffusion of Ag+ ions (the activation energy of 482 meV for ion jumps was determined from solid-state ionic conductivity measurements) while the tumbling motions are likely made possible by either impurities or local disorder, allowing for easier reorientations of the boron cages.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Gradisěk, Anton","Jørgensen, Mathias","Paskevicius, Mark","R. S. Hansen, Bjarne","Jensen, Torben René"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-183018"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD","Oceania"],"corresponding_author":["Gradisěk, Anton"],"country":["Australia","Slovenia"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Curtin University","J. Stefan Institute"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"molecular dynamics in ag sub 000000000002 sub b sub 000000000012 sub h sub 000000000012 sub studied by nuclear magnetic resonance","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpcc.1c00528","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-183018","identifier":[{"id":"85103462816","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-5e23764b-7c78-4b18-9e1d-f71ef997ed6b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-EFEB13BD95DB37A11BBBFC431519F7FD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpcc.1c00528","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/306993526/acs.jpcc.1c00528.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"si","key":"j stefan institute","loc":["Slovenia","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"J. Stefan Institute","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Chemistry","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"au","key":"curtin university","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"Curtin University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anton","key":"gradisěkpau","last":"Gradisěk","name":"Gradisěk, Anton","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mathias","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"32e93198-01d2-4718-84d6-d305f21bff00","name":"Jørgensen, Mathias","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Mark","key":"paskeviciuspau","last":"Paskevicius","locid":"e26eea7d-e55a-4989-80de-dfafd2146511","name":"Paskevicius, Mark","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Bjarne R.S.","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"95e2932e-526e-4795-b38a-7ab221f891ae","name":"R. S. Hansen, Bjarne","name_org":"Hansen, Bjarne R.S.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torben R.","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"e0750478-df89-45bf-aa48-b6a86de93fa0","name":"Jensen, Torben René","name_org":"Jensen, Torben R.","orcid":"0000-0002-4278-3221","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1021/acs.jpcc.1c00528","issn":["19327447","19327455"],"issn_org":["19327447"],"issue":"10","journal":"Journal of Physical Chemistry C","pages":"5534-5541","publisher":"American Chemical Society","status":"p","title":"Journal of Physical Chemistry C","volume":"125"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85103462816"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-5e23764b-7c78-4b18-9e1d-f71ef997ed6b"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Molecular dynamics in Ag<sub>2</sub>B<sub>12</sub>H<sub>12</sub> studied by nuclear magnetic resonance","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-183018","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Carbapenems are critically important antimicrobials for the treatment of clinical infections caused by MDR Enterobacteriaceae, with colistin reserved for those cases in which even carbapenems are ineffective. Therefore, co-localization of carbapenem and colistin resistance genes on the same plasmid is worrisome and, to date, has been described only in China in an Escherichia coli from a diseased chicken (blaNDM-4 and mcr-1 on an IncHI2/ST3 plasmid)1 and in an E. coli from a diseased pet cat (blaNDM-5 and mcr-1 on an IncX3-X4 hybrid plasmid).2 Here, we report a novel case of co-localization of blaOXA-162 carbapenemase and mcr-1 on a transferable IncHI2 plasmid in E. coli from a healthy broiler chicken in Europe.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Bortolaia, Valeria","Ronco, Troels","Romascu, Luminita","Nicorescu, Isabela","Milita, Nicoleta M.","Vaduva, Angela M.","Leekitcharoenphon, Pimlapas","Kjeldgaard, Jette Sejer","Hansen, Inge M.","Svendsen, Christina Aaby","Mordhorst, Hanne","Guerra, Beatriz","Beloeil, Pierre-Alexandre","Hoffmann, Maria","Hendriksen, Rene S."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-336892"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Ronco, Troels"],"country":["Italy","Romania","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","European Food Safety Authority","United States Food and Drug Administration","University of Bucharest"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"co localization of carbapenem i bla i sub oxa 000000000162 sub and colistin i mcr 000000000001 i resistance genes on a transferable inchi000000000002 plasmid in i escherichia coli i of chicken origin","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/jac/dkab285","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-336892","identifier":[{"id":"34392339","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85119049046","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC8521400","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["dtu-6c3281a3-e100-464c-bfa1-32958d690cf9"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-566F715F1A822EEBD8912B3C1AD9B66D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/jac/dkab285","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/264174151/dkab285.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Food Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"ro","key":"university of bucharest","loc":["Romania","Europe, EU"],"name":"University of Bucharest","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"it","key":"european food safety authority","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"European Food Safety Authority","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"us","key":"united states food and drug administration","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"United States Food and Drug Administration","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Valeria","key":"bortolaiapau","last":"Bortolaia","locid":"8b1160d2-649f-4663-8512-010214af6ab4","name":"Bortolaia, Valeria","orcid":"0000-0001-6559-7344","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first