{"abstract":"BACKGROUND CONTEXT: Postoperative pyogenic spondylodiscitis is associated with prolonged antimicrobial therapy and high relapse rates. Cefuroxime is a time-dependent antimicrobial widely used for intravenous perioperative prophylaxis in spine surgery. A previous study has indicated that a single dose of cefuroxime (1.5 g) provides insufficient spine tissue concentrations for spine procedures lasting more than 2-3 hours. PURPOSE: To evaluate the time with concentrations above relevant minimal inhibitory concentrations (T>MIC) in plasma, subcutaneous adipose tissue, vertebral cancellous bone, and intervertebral disc after a twofold increase of the standard dosage of 1.5 g cefuroxime given as one double dose (1 × 3 g) or two single doses (2 × 1.5 g) with a four-hour interval. METHOD: Sixteen pigs were randomized into two groups: Group 1 received one double dose of cefuroxime (1 × 3 g) as an intravenous bolus and Group 2 received two single doses of cefuroxime (2 × 1.5 g) as an intravenous bolus with a four-hour interval. Cefuroxime measurements were obtained from plasma, subcutaneous adipose tissue, vertebral cancellous bone, and intervertebral disc for eight hours thereafter. Microdialysis was applied for sampling in solid tissues. The cefuroxime concentrations were determined using ultra-high performance liquid chromatography. This work was supported by grants from the Health Research Foundation of Central Denmark Region (Amount: 70.000 dollars). The funding source did not play any role in the investigation. RESULTS: The time with concentrations above the Staphylococcus aureus clinical breakpoint minimal inhibitory concentration of 4 μg/mL was higher in all compartments for Group 2 compared with Group 1. The mean T>MIC (4 μg/mL) in all compartments ranged between 47%-67% for Group 1 and 72%-92% for Group 2. Furthermore, a delayed tissue penetration into all tissues for both groups was demonstrated. CONCLUSION: This study suggests that cefuroxime should be given at least 45 min prior to spine procedures and as two single doses at a maximum interval of four hours for extended spine procedures. Clinical studies verifying these results are warranted. CLINICAL SIGNIFICANCE: Administering cefuroxime as two single doses (2 × 1.5 g) with a four-hour interval compared with one double dose (1 × 3 g) resulted in higher T>MIC. Furthermore, we found delayed and incomplete cefuroxime tissue penetration.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Hanberg, Pelle","Bue, Mats","Jørgensen, Andrea René","Thomassen, Maja","Öbrink-Hansen, Kristina","Søballe, Kjeld","Stilling, Maiken"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-188301"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Cefuroxime","Intervertebral disc","Microdialysis","Pharmacokinetics","Tissue penetration","Vertebra"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"pharmacokinetics of double dose cefuroxime in porcine intervertebral disc and vertebral cancellous bone a randomized microdialysis study","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85083046912","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-188301","identifier":[{"id":"32194245","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85083046912","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-6741d5ea-f3d9-4a0b-90f0-12eaf9db2dcf"],"keyword":["Cefuroxime","Intervertebral disc","Microdialysis","Pharmacokinetics","Tissue penetration","Vertebra"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-42D12D7194BC32FAA9124839A755B494"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Orthopaedic surgery","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Ortopædkirurgi, Horsens"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Pelle","key":"hanbergpau","last":"Hanberg","locid":"242cb61c-bb82-4d48-9af7-8c84a17ab00e","name":"Hanberg, Pelle","orcid":"0000-0002-6845-1874","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mats","key":"buepau","last":"Bue","locid":"2a35a61c-3bf9-4bf7-9569-73178247b08c","name":"Bue, Mats","orcid":"0000-0001-7215-8323","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andrea René","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"105e5e1d-0600-4cd5-94cb-68291474afab","name":"Jørgensen, Andrea René","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Maja","key":"thomassenpau","last":"Thomassen","locid":"94d2a94b-8b7e-4e39-b90d-8bdcd449ea81","name":"Thomassen, Maja","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristina","key":"öbrinkhansenpau","last":"Öbrink-Hansen","locid":"ad46bc19-97e8-4c7c-aab9-c4e569877dad","name":"Öbrink-Hansen, Kristina","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kjeld","key":"søballepau","last":"Søballe","locid":"288247bb-1768-4f37-a538-18727fed269b","name":"Søballe, Kjeld","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Maiken","key":"stillingpau","last":"Stilling","locid":"bb005d3f-27c9-4157-8101-db5059373d32","name":"Stilling, Maiken","orcid":"0000-0002-4530-2075","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["32194245"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.spinee.2020.03.006","issn":["15299430","18781632"],"issn_org":["15299430"],"issue":"8","journal":"Spine Journal","pages":"1327-1332","publisher":"Elsevier Inc.","status":"p","title":"Spine Journal","title_org":"The spine journal : official journal of the North American Spine Society","volume":"20"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85083046912"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-6741d5ea-f3d9-4a0b-90f0-12eaf9db2dcf"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Pharmacokinetics of double-dose cefuroxime in porcine intervertebral disc and vertebral cancellous bone - A randomized microdialysis study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-188301","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"SBi-anvisning 272 forklarer og fortolker bestemmelserne i Bygningsreglement 2018 (BR18) gældende fra 1. juli 2018. Med BR18 er indført en ny kapitelstruktur. Samtidig er kravene til myndighedsbehandlingen ændret, og er for brandforhold og bærende konstruktioner erstattet af en certificeringsordning. Anvisningen har samme kapitelstruktur som bygningsreglementet, og SBi's anvisningstekst ledsages af den fulde reglementstekst samt teksten i Trafik-, Bygge- og Boligstyrelsens hovedvejledninger. Desuden henviser anvisningen til relevante standarder, andre SBi-anvisninger og andet baggrundsmateriale fra det almene tekniske fælleseje med uddybende information. Anvisningen omhandler de samme emner som BR18: administrative bestemmelser, adgangsforhold, affaldssystemer, afløbsinstallationer, brandforhold, brugerbetjente anlæg, byggepladsen, byggeret og helhedsvurdering, bygningers indretning, elevatorer, energiforbrug, energiforsyningsanlæg, forureninger, fugt og vådrum, konstruktioner, legepladser, lydforhold, lys og udsyn, termisk indeklima, ubebyggede arealer, vandinstallationer og ventilation. Anvisningen henvender sig til alle professionelle parter i byggeriet, særligt projekterende og kommunale byggesagsbehandlere.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Hansen, Ernst Jan De Place","Ginnerup, Søren","Sigbrand, Lone","Jensen, Ole Michael","Brandt, Erik","Morelli, Martin","Sørensen, Lars Schiøtt","Cornelius, Thomas","Møller, Eva B.","Kirkeby, Inge Mette","Kragh, Jesper","Aggerholm, Søren","Wittchen, Kim Bjarne","Dahl Nielsen, Rene","Gunnarsen, Lars","Rasmussen, Torben Valdbjørn","Aagaard, Niels-Jørgen","Rasmussen, Birgit","Johnsen, Kjeld","Bergsøe, Niels Christian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-317458"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bebyggelsesregulerende bestemmelser","Bygningsindretning","Dokumentation","Energiforbrug","Fugt","Indeklima","Installationer","Konstruktioner","Luftkvalitet","Lyd","Lys","Tilgængelighed","Vand","Ventilation","Vådrum","byggetilladelser"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"anvisning om bygningsreglement 000000002018","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-317458","ids":["dtu-2b4bbada-1ea1-4f8a-ac67-b20be8bde499"],"keyword":["bebyggelsesregulerende bestemmelser","byggetilladelser","bygningsindretning","dokumentation","energiforbrug","fugt","indeklima","installationer","konstruktioner","luftkvalitet","lyd","lys","tilgængelighed","vand","ventilation","vådrum"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-29F35383237E878D4E99E5B867969037"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Civil Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ernst Jan De Place","key":"hansenernstjandeplacepau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Ernst Jan De Place","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"ginnerupsørenpau","last":"Ginnerup","name":"Ginnerup, Søren","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lone","key":"sigbrandlonepau","last":"Sigbrand","name":"Sigbrand, Lone","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole Michael","key":"jensenolemichaelpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Ole Michael","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Erik","key":"brandterikpau","last":"Brandt","name":"Brandt, Erik","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"morellimartinpau","last":"Morelli","name":"Morelli, Martin","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Schiøtt","key":"sørensenlarsschiøttpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Lars Schiøtt","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"corneliusthomaspau","last":"Cornelius","name":"Cornelius, Thomas","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Eva B.","key":"møllerevabpau","last":"Møller","name":"Møller, Eva B.","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Inge Mette","key":"kirkebyingemettepau","last":"Kirkeby","name":"Kirkeby, Inge Mette","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"kraghjesperpau","last":"Kragh","name":"Kragh, Jesper","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"aggerholmsørenpau","last":"Aggerholm","name":"Aggerholm, Søren","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kim Bjarne","key":"wittchenkimbjarnepau","last":"Wittchen","name":"Wittchen, Kim Bjarne","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Rene","key":"dahlnielsenrenepau","last":"Dahl Nielsen","name":"Dahl Nielsen, Rene","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"gunnarsenlarspau","last":"Gunnarsen","name":"Gunnarsen, Lars","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Torben Valdbjørn","key":"rasmussentorbenvaldbjørnpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Torben Valdbjørn","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels-Jørgen","key":"aagaardnielsjørgenpau","last":"Aagaard","locid":"8849ede5-0d46-45c4-b8fe-2e4f06f65e3e","name":"Aagaard, Niels-Jørgen","orcid":"0000-0002-3230-5533","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Birgit","key":"rasmussenbirgitpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Birgit","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kjeld","key":"johnsenkjeldpau","last":"Johnsen","name":"Johnsen, Kjeld","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels Christian","key":"bergsøenielschristianpau","last":"Bergsøe","name":"Bergsøe, Niels Christian","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"edition":"2","eisbn":["9788756319355"],"isbn":["9788756319348"],"issn":["01066757"],"issue":"272","publisher":"Statens Byggeforskningsinstitut","series":"SBi-anvisning","status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-2b4bbada-1ea1-4f8a-ac67-b20be8bde499"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Anvisning om Bygningsreglement 2018","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-317458","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Bovine colostrum (BC) contains bioactive proteins, such as immunoglobulin G (IgG), lactoferrin (LF) and lactoperoxidase (LP). BC was subjected to low-temperature, long-time pasteurization (LTLT, 63 °C, 30 min) or high-temperature, short-time pasteurization (HTST, 72 °C, 15 s) and spray-drying (SD), with or without γ-irradiation (GI, ∼14 kGy) to remove microbial contamination. Relative to unpasteurized liquid BC, SD plus GI increased protein denaturation by 6 and 11%, respectively, increasing to 19 and 27% after LTLT and to 48% after HTST, with no further effects after GI (all P < 0.05). LTLT, without or with GI, resulted in 15 or 29% denaturation of IgG, compared with non-pasteurized BC, and 34 or 58% for HTST treatment (all P < 0.05, except LTLT without GI). For IgG, only GI, not SD or LTLT, increased denaturation (30-38%, P < 0.05) but HTST increased denaturation to 40%, with further increases after GI (60%, P < 0.05). LTLT and HTST reduced LP levels (56 and 81% respectively) and LTLT reduced LF levels (21%), especially together with GI (47%, P < 0.05). Denaturation of BSA, β-LgA, β-LgB and α-La were similar to IgG. Methionine, a protective amino acid against free oxygen radicals, was oxidised by LTLT + GI (P < 0.05) while LTLT and HTST had no effect. Many anti-inflammatory proteins, including serpin anti-proteinases were highly sensitive to HTST and GI but preserved after LTLT pasteurization. LTLT, followed by SD is an optimal processing technique preserving bioactive proteins when powdered BC is used as a diet supplement for sensitive patients.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Chatterton, Dereck Edward Winston","Aagaard, Sasha","Hesselballe Hansen, Tim","Nguyen, Duc Ninh","De Gobba, Cristian","Lametsch, Rene","Sangild, Per Torp"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-397916"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"bioactive proteins in bovine colostrum and effects of heating drying and irradiation","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-397916","identifier":[{"id":"32108849","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85082542701","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-07727646-2ba0-41ca-b6c4-d0978f523f6b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A88F1EDAF1830345A0839D09F46E98F3"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Food Science, Ingredient and Dairy Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Biofiber-Damino (Biz)"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Dereck E. W.","key":"chattertonpau","last":"Chatterton","locid":"0a702331-bea9-4fe6-8e8f-a32b3d94da7c","name":"Chatterton, Dereck Edward Winston","name_org":"Chatterton, Dereck E. W.","orcid":"0000-0002-8417-3210","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sasha","key":"aagaardpau","last":"Aagaard","locid":"40b803ba-7b6a-4fe1-b44d-d478ef97d32d","name":"Aagaard, Sasha","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Tim","key":"hesselballehansenpau","last":"Hesselballe Hansen","name":"Hesselballe Hansen, Tim","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Duc Ninh","key":"nguyenpau","last":"Nguyen","locid":"ac871ba3-ea88-47b6-aff9-59238f98ce68","name":"Nguyen, Duc Ninh","orcid":"0000-0002-4997-555X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Cristian","key":"degobbapau","last":"De Gobba","locid":"4cc61c67-17b6-4a97-8fd0-bacce728ae62","name":"De Gobba, Cristian","orcid":"0000-0002-2774-5876","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"René","key":"lametschpau","last":"Lametsch","locid":"70bd350a-6869-4a4a-b9bc-56a756376784","name":"Lametsch, Rene","name_org":"Lametsch, René","orcid":"0000-0002-4189-806X","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Per T.","key":"sangildpau","last":"Sangild","locid":"d0225a7f-ad88-418d-8660-bff37f7358d9","name":"Sangild, Per Torp","name_org":"Sangild, Per T.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["32108849"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1039/c9fo02998b","issn":["20426496","2042650X"],"issn_org":["20426496"],"issue":"3","journal":"Food & Function","pages":"2309-2327","status":"p","title":"Food & Function","volume":"11"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85082542701"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen","biofiber-damino (biz)"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-07727646-2ba0-41ca-b6c4-d0978f523f6b"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Bioactive proteins in bovine colostrum and effects of heating, drying and irradiation","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-397916","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Overloading of tendon tissue with resulting chronic pain (tendinopathy) is a common disorder in occupational-, leisure- and sports-activity, but its pathogenesis remains poorly understood. To investigate the very early phase of tendinopathy, Achilles and patellar tendons were investigated in 200 physically active patients and 50 healthy control persons. Patients were divided into three groups: symptoms for 0-1 months (T1), 1-2 months (T2) or 2-3 months (T3). Tendinopathic Achilles tendon cross-sectional area determined by ultrasonography (US) was ~25% larger than in healthy control persons. Both Achilles and patellar anterior-posterior diameter were elevated in tendinopathy, and only later in Achilles was the width increased. Increased tendon size was accompanied by an increase in hypervascularization (US Doppler flow) without any change in mRNA for angiogenic factors. From patellar biopsies taken bilaterally, mRNA for most growth factors and tendon components remained unchanged (except for TGF-beta1 and substance-P) in early tendinopathy. Tendon stiffness remained unaltered over the first three months of tendinopathy and was similar to the asymptomatic contra-lateral tendon. In conclusion, this suggests that tendinopathy pathogenesis represents a disturbed tissue homeostasis with fluid accumulation. The disturbance is likely induced by repeated mechanical overloading rather than a partial rupture of the tendon.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Tran, Peter H.T.","Malmgaard-Clausen, Nikolaj M.","Puggaard, Rikke S.","Svensson, Rene B.","Nybing, Janus D.","Hansen, Philip","Schjerling, Peter","Zinglersen, Amanda H.","Couppé, Christian","Boesen, Mikael","Magnusson, S. Peter","Kjaer, Michael"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-457496"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Clinical","Inflammation","Tendinopathy","Ultrasound","mRNA"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"early development of tendinopathy in humans sequence of pathological changes in structure and tissue turnover signaling","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-457496","identifier":[{"id":"85077741381","type":"scopus"},{"id":"31914656","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-6b4ac2f8-c1e5-4034-865a-c3edc0361ec8"],"keyword":["clinical","inflammation","mRNA","tendinopathy","ultrasound"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D127BE1DA7D385186A2A028F0E317E82"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Center for Healthy Ageing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Peter H.T.","key":"tranpau","last":"Tran","name":"Tran, Peter H.T.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Nikolaj M.","key":"malmgaardclausenpau","last":"Malmgaard-Clausen","name":"Malmgaard-Clausen, Nikolaj M.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Rikke S.","key":"puggaardpau","last":"Puggaard","name":"Puggaard, Rikke S.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"René B.","key":"svenssonpau","last":"Svensson","locid":"fe236d1a-ef32-4a22-8125-31211110d8c8","name":"Svensson, Rene B.","name_org":"Svensson, René B.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Janus D.","key":"nybingpau","last":"Nybing","name":"Nybing, Janus D.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Philip","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Philip","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Peter","key":"schjerlingpau","last":"Schjerling","name":"Schjerling, Peter","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Amanda H.","key":"zinglersenpau","last":"Zinglersen","name":"Zinglersen, Amanda H.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Christian","key":"couppépau","last":"Couppé","locid":"cad96e2a-ff10-4b12-a6a7-276468235915","name":"Couppé, Christian","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mikael","key":"boesenpau","last":"Boesen","locid":"b449f652-d441-4b23-836f-2d5111ef64dd","name":"Boesen, Mikael","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"S. Peter","key":"magnussonpau","last":"Magnusson","locid":"6f430caa-ac01-4dfe-9a62-e3a49afba21a","name":"Magnusson, S. Peter","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Michael","key":"kjaerpau","last":"Kjaer","locid":"7937b8ab-7820-4d25-982f-1d2f58b033a3","name":"Kjaer, Michael","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31914656"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1096/fj.201901309r","issn":["08926638","15306860"],"issn_org":["08926638"],"issue":"1","journal":"FASEB Journal","pages":"776-788","status":"p","title":"FASEB Journal","volume":"34"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85077741381"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-6b4ac2f8-c1e5-4034-865a-c3edc0361ec8"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Early development of tendinopathy in humans : Sequence of pathological changes in structure and tissue turnover signaling","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-457496","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
