{"abstract":"Randomness beacons are services that periodically emit a random number, allowing users to agree on the same random outcome without trusting anyone: ideally, the randomness beacon is secure (cannot be influenced) and transparent (can be monitored by users). Hence, such randomness beacons can serve as an important primitive for smart contracts in a variety of contexts. In this paper we aim to bridge the gap between theory and practice of public beacon design inspired by the unicorn protocol of Lenstra and Wesolowski using verifiable delay functions. We first present a structured security analysis, based on which we design, implement, and evaluate a trustworthy and efficient randomness beacon allowing users to join at any time. We then compare different implementation and deployment options on distributed ledgers, and report on a Ethereum smart contract-based lottery using our beacon.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Dharanikot, Samvid","Jensen, Michael Toft","Kristensen, Sebastian Rom","Michno, Mathias Sass","Pignolet, Yvonne Anne","Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Schmid, Stefan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-061873"],"event":{"end":"2019-07-17","place":"Atlanta, us","start":"2019-07-14","title":"2019 IEEE International Conference on Blockchain (Blockchain)","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Austria"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Vienna"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"breeding unicorns developing trustworthy and scalable randomness beacons","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-061873","identifier":[{"id":"85078700404","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-28d0ed2b-9c8e-4296-9957-94670ecb7a90"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-5-8-ABFF7CDF90F80BC35DD18F4E76CF1A56"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"at","key":"university of vienna","loc":["Austria","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Vienna","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Samvid","key":"dharanikotpau","last":"Dharanikot","name":"Dharanikot, Samvid","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Michael Toft","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"074a0078-4dbc-4d84-99f8-673898fda707","name":"Jensen, Michael Toft","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Sebastian Rom","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"7c1614ce-7148-47c4-bd55-5e26fa11c185","name":"Kristensen, Sebastian Rom","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mathias Sass","key":"michnopau","last":"Michno","locid":"83e7d891-0b39-448d-ab29-7d6995b3a856","name":"Michno, Mathias Sass","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Yvonne Anne","key":"pignoletpau","last":"Pignolet","name":"Pignolet, Yvonne Anne","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","name_org":"Hansen, René Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Stefan","key":"schmidpau","last":"Schmid","name":"Schmid, Stefan","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/blockchain.2019.00022","eisbn":["9781728146935"],"isbn":["9781728146942"],"pages":"99-106","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","status":"p","title":"2019 IEEE International Conference on Blockchain (Blockchain)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85078700404","2-s2.0-85083915758"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-28d0ed2b-9c8e-4296-9957-94670ecb7a90"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Breeding Unicorns : Developing Trustworthy and Scalable Randomness Beacons","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-061873","year":"2019","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"This book constitutes the refereed proceedings of the 24th Nordic Conference on Secure IT Systems, NordSec 2019, held in Aalborg, Denmark, in November 2019. The 17 full papers presented in this volume were carefully reviewed and selected from 32 submissions. They are organized in topical sections named: privacy; network security; platform security and malware; and system and software security.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Askarov, Aslan","Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Rafnsson, Willard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-062783"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"secure it systems 000000000024th nordic conference nordsec 000000002019 aalborg denmark november 000000000018 000000000020 000000002019 proceedings","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-062783","ids":["aau-2bf28fa9-9ed5-4f2d-95c1-a99c050f325c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-B3B9DAE900F7906D14583C74C2B597D0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed, Embedded and Intelligent Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Aslan","key":"askarovped","last":"Askarov","name":"Askarov, Aslan","rank":1,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenped","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","name_org":"Hansen, René Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":2,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Willard","key":"rafnssonped","last":"Rafnsson","name":"Rafnsson, Willard","rank":3,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-35055-0","eisbn":["9783030350550"],"isbn":["9783030350543"],"issn":["03029743"],"publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-2bf28fa9-9ed5-4f2d-95c1-a99c050f325c"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Secure IT Systems - 24th Nordic Conference, NordSec 2019, Aalborg, Denmark, November 18-20, 2019, Proceedings","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-062783","year":"2019","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Metal closo-boranes show remarkable thermal and chemical stabilities, making them appealing candidates for a wide range of applications, such as electrolytes in electrochemical batteries and ammonia storage for indirect hydrogen storage. Furthermore, owing to the large size and nonspherical geometry of the anion (e.g., B10H10 2- or B12H12 2-), metal closo-boranes display a rich structural diversity and thermal polymorphism. Here, we present the synthesis, characterization, and structural determination of the ammoniated metal closo-boranes, Na2B10H10·nNH3 (n = 1, 2). The thermal decomposition of Na2B10H10·2NH3 was investigated with synchrotron radiation in situ powder X-ray diffraction and simultaneous thermogravimetric analysis, differential scanning calorimetry, and mass spectrometry, revealing a reversible ammonia storage capacity of 15 wt % below 150 °C. Additionally, ionic conductivities of 2.7 × 10-8 (RT) and 4.7 × 10-8 S/cm (30 °C) for Na2B10H10·2NH3 and Na2B10H10·NH3, respectively, were measured with electrochemical impedance spectroscopy. A lower Na+ conductivity compared to the parent compound, Na2B10H10, is explained by an anchoring effect of ammonia in the rigid framework of the B10H10 2--anions.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Mathias","Hansen, Bjarne R.S.","Lee, Young Su","Cho, Young Whan","Jensen, Torben René"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-179743"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Jensen, Torben René"],"country":["South Korea"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Korea Institute of Science and Technology"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"crystal structures and energy storage properties of ammine sodium decahydro closo decaboranes na sub 000000000002 sub b sub 000000000010 sub h sub 000000000010 sub nnh sub 000000000003 sub n 000000000001 000000000002","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85071499102","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-179743","identifier":[{"id":"85071499102","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-5865ee69-3d3c-4a9e-acab-f0cc444e059c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-7FD079A060FC6D9B9D7429607ABB1393"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Chemistry","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center - INANO-Kemi, Langelandsgade"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Technological Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"kr","key":"korea institute of science and technology","loc":["South Korea","Asia, East","OECD"],"name":"Korea Institute of Science and Technology","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mathias","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"32e93198-01d2-4718-84d6-d305f21bff00","name":"Jørgensen, Mathias","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Bjarne R.S.","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Bjarne R.S.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Young Su","key":"leepau","last":"Lee","name":"Lee, Young Su","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Young Whan","key":"chopau","last":"Cho","name":"Cho, Young Whan","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torben R.","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"e0750478-df89-45bf-aa48-b6a86de93fa0","name":"Jensen, Torben René","name_org":"Jensen, Torben R.","orcid":"0000-0002-4278-3221","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1021/acs.jpcc.9b06084","issn":["19327447","19327455"],"issn_org":["19327447"],"issue":"33","journal":"Journal of Physical Chemistry C","pages":"20160-20166","publisher":"American Chemical Society","status":"p","title":"Journal of Physical Chemistry C","volume":"123"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85071499102"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-5865ee69-3d3c-4a9e-acab-f0cc444e059c"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Crystal Structures and Energy Storage Properties of Ammine Sodium Decahydro- closo-decaboranes (Na<sub>2</sub>B<sub>10</sub>H<sub>10</sub>· nNH<sub>3</sub>, n = 1, 2)","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-179743","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"author_count":6,"contributors":["Stigel Hansen, Bjarke Mørkøre","Karlsen, Mads Peter","Rosfort, René"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-287045"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"indledning","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-287045","ids":["cbs-7a188bb9-b385-4c74-b1b6-7fac28fdcd0c"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-4382E89BED389FA3670A695C4A27A16F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Management, Politics and Philosophy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bjarke Mørkøre","key":"stigelhansenpau","last":"Stigel Hansen","name":"Stigel Hansen, Bjarke Mørkøre","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mads Peter","key":"karlsenpau","last":"Karlsen","locid":"b9d8e839-6435-45a8-b2af-440a8a65aa53","name":"Karlsen, Mads Peter","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René","key":"rosfortpau","last":"Rosfort","name":"Rosfort, René","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Bjarke Mørkøre","key":"stigelhansenpedh","last":"Stigel Hansen","name":"Stigel Hansen, Bjarke Mørkøre","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Mads Peter","key":"karlsenpedh","last":"Karlsen","name":"Karlsen, Mads Peter","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"René","key":"rosfortpedh","last":"Rosfort","name":"Rosfort, René","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788741005218"],"pages":"9-44","place":"Frederiksberg","publisher":"Eksistensen Akademisk","status":"p","subtitle":"Eksistentiel hermeneutik. Bind 1","title":"Filosofiske essays af Arne Grøn"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-7a188bb9-b385-4c74-b1b6-7fac28fdcd0c"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Indledning","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-287045","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Objectives: This study compares the genome of an ST131 CMY-2-producing Escherichia coli isolate from a Danish patient with other ST131 CMY-2-producing E. coli isolates of both human and animal origin. Methods: In 2016, an ST131 CMY-2-producing E. coli isolate (ESBL20160056) was obtained from a patient with a bloodstream infection. The genome of the ESBL20160056 isolate was compared with genomes from six ST131 CMY-2-producing E. coli isolates obtained from broiler meat imported to Denmark, 15 ST131 CMY-2-producing E. coli isolates obtained from Enterobase (http://enterobase.warwick.ac.uk) and two ST131 CMY-2-producing E. coli from European collaborators. The plasmid from ESBL20160056 was sequenced using a MinION Mk1B (Oxford Nanopore Technologies). Results: The E. coli isolate from the Danish patient clustered together with 13 other fimH22 ST131 CMY-2-producing E. coli isolates in a distinct clade. The clade consisted of genomes from six E. coli isolates from humans collected in Denmark, Spain, Cambodia and the USA, six E. coli isolates obtained from broiler meat samples imported to Denmark from France, the Netherlands and Germany, and two E. coli isolates obtained from broilers in Belgium and Luxembourg. The 101.5 kb plasmid with blaCMY-2 from ESBL20160056 had an IncI1 replicon and belonged to ST12 using the plasmid MLST scheme. In total, 10 of the 14 ST131 E. coli isolates belonging to the fimH22 clade carried an IncI1 ST12 plasmid with blaCMY-2. Conclusions: From our data, it seems plausible that the ST131 fimH22 CMY-2-producing E. coli isolate obtained from the Danish patient could have a zoonotic broiler origin.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Roer, Louise","Overballe-Petersen, Søren","Hansen, Frank","Johannesen, Thor B","Stegger, Marc","Bortolaia, Valeria","Leekitcharoenphon, Pimlapas","Korsgaard, Helle Bisgaard","Seyfarth, Anne Mette","Mossong, Joël","Wattiau, Pierre","Boland, Cécile","Hansen, Dennis S","Hasman, Henrik","Hammerum, Anette M","Hendriksen, Rene S."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-316492"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Hammerum, Anette M"],"country":["Belgium","Luxembourg"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Laboratoire National de Santé","Sciensano"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"OT":["Danish Veterinary and Food Administration"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"st000000000131 fimh000000000022 escherichia coli isolate with a blacmy 000000000002 inci000000000001 st000000000012 plasmid obtained from a patient with bloodstream infection highly similar to e coli isolates of broiler origin","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85061606644","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-316492","identifier":[{"id":"85061606644","type":"scopus"},{"id":"30496481","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-2818b569-f4a0-4769-989f-d2ef4a6edc1a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-39D1CDFC378540264D7E7FF560EA5971"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ssi statens serum institut","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-SSI","l3nn":"SSI Statens Serum Institut","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SSI Statens Serum Institut","namevar":["Statens Serum Institut"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-SSI","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University