Lametsch","locid":"70bd350a-6869-4a4a-b9bc-56a756376784","name":"Lametsch, Rene","orcid":"0000-0002-4189-806X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Erik Torngaard","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Erik Torngaard","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jorge","key":"ruizcarrascalpau","last":"Ruiz Carrascal","locid":"655f62cc-8d9b-42fd-9710-4f2e3bbc8774","name":"Ruiz Carrascal, Jorge","orcid":"0000-0001-7905-3153","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/jfpe.12994","issn":["01458876","17454530"],"issn_org":["01458876"],"issue":"3","journal":"Journal of Food Process Engineering","pages":"1-8","paperid":"e12994","status":"p","title":"Journal of Food Process Engineering","volume":"42"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85060756757"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen","danish crown ingredients"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-21aadb77-b78b-4e0f-a546-f038234ffd01"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Storage and thermal stability of novel heme-based pigments prepared from porcine hemoglobin","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-413563","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Wetlands are often vital physical and social components of a country's natural capital, as well as providers of ecosystem services to local and national communities. We performed a network analysis to prioritize Sustainable Development Goal (SDG) targets for sustainable development in iconic wetlands and wetlandscapes around the world. The analysis was based on the information and perceptions on 45 wetlandscapes worldwide by 49 wetland researchers of the GlobalWetland Ecohydrological Network (GWEN). We identified three 2030 Agenda targets of high priority across the wetlandscapes needed to achieve sustainable development: Target 6.3-\"Improve water quality\"; 2.4-\"Sustainable food production\"; and 12.2-\"Sustainable management of resources\". Moreover, we found specific feedback mechanisms and synergies between SDG targets in the context of wetlands. The most consistent reinforcing interactions were the influence of Target 12.2 on 8.4-\"Efficient resource consumption\"; and that of Target 6.3 on 12.2. The wetlandscapes could be differentiated in four bundles of distinctive priority SDG-targets: \"Basic human needs\", \"Sustainable tourism\", \"Environmental impact in urban wetlands\", and \"Improving and conserving environment\". In general, we find that the SDG groups, targets, and interactions stress that maintaining good water quality and a \"wise use\" of wetlandscapes are vital to attaining sustainable development within these sensitive ecosystems.","author_count":52,"contributors":["Jaramillo, Fernando","Desormeaux, Amanda","Hedlund, Johanna","Jawitz, James W.","Clerici, Nicola","Piemontese, Luigi","Rodríguez-Rodriguez, Jenny Alexandra","Anaya, Jesús Adolfo","Blanco-Libreros, Juan F.","Borja, Sonia","Celi, Jorge","Chalov, Sergey","Chun, Kwok Pan","Cresso, Matilda","Destouni, Georgia","Dessu, Shimelis Behailu","Di Baldassarre, Giuliano","Downing, Andrea","Espinosa, Luisa","Ghajarnia, Navid","Girard, Pierre","Gutiérrez, Álvaro G.","Hansen, Amy","Hu, Tengfei","Jarsjö, Jerker","Kalantary, Zahra","Labbaci, Adnane","Licero-Villanueva, Lucia","Livsey, John","Machotka, Ewa","McCurley, Kathryn","Palomino-ángel, Sebastián","Pietron, Jan","Price, René","Ramchunder, Sorain J.","Ricaurte-Villota, Constanza","Ricaurte, Luisa Fernanda","Dahir, Lula","Rodríguez, Erasmo","Salgado, Jorge","Sannel, A. Britta K.","Santos, Ana Carolina","Seifollahi-Aghmiuni, Samaneh","Sjöberg, Ylva","Sun, Lian","Thorslund, Josefin","Vigouroux, Guillaume","Wang-Erlandsson, Lan","Xu, Diandian","Zamora, David","Ziegler, Alan D.","Åhlén, Imenne"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-425029"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Africa","America, North","America, South","Asia, East","Asia, South","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Brazil","Chile","China","Colombia","Ecuador","Hong Kong","Morocco","Poland","Russia","Singapore","Sweden","United States"],"glorg":["'José Benito Vives de Andreis'-INVEMAR","All Global Affiliations","Beijing Normal University","Florida International University","Hohai University","Hong Kong Baptist University","Ibn Zohr University","Instituto de Investigación de Recursos Biológicos Alexander von Humboldt, Bogota","Kazimierz Wielki University","Lomonosov Moscow State University","Nanjing Hydraulic Research Institute","National University of Singapore","Stockholm University","Universidad Católica de Colombia","Universidad Nacional de Colombia","Universidad Regional Amazónica Ikiam","Universidad de Antioquia","Universidad de Chile","Universidad de Medellín","Universidad del Rosario","Universidade Federal de Mato Grosso","University of Florida","University of Kansas","University of Los Andes","Uppsala University"],"keyword":["Interactions","Network analysis","Priorities","SDGs","Sustainable development goals","Wetlands"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"priorities and interactions of sustainable development goals sdgs with focus on wetlands","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/w11030619","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-425029","identifier":[{"id":"85065022106","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-352b6aa8-630e-4dca-9ae6-a5ee72d44cf1"],"keyword":["Interactions","Network analysis","Priorities","SDGs","Sustainable development goals","Wetlands","Wetlandscapes"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-771A39729D11DF69E737E94EA15E6D80"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/223564629/Priorities_and_Interactions_of_Sustainable_Development_Goals_SDGs_with_Focus_on_Wetlands.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/w11030619","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"se","key":"stockholm university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Stockholm University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"university of florida","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Florida","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"co","key":"universidad del rosario","loc":["Colombia","America, South","OECD"],"name":"Universidad del Rosario","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"co","key":"josé benito vives de andreis invemar","loc":["Colombia","America, South","OECD"],"name":"'José Benito Vives de Andreis'-INVEMAR","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"co","key":"universidad de medellín","loc":["Colombia","America, South","OECD"],"name":"Universidad de Medellín","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"c