{"abstract":"Adaption of technologies being used on the web is changing frequently, requiring applications that interact with the web to continuously change their ability to parse it. This has led most web crawlers to either inherent simplistic parsing capabilities, differentiating from web browsers, or use a web browser with high-level interactions that restricts observable information. We introduce Kraaler, an open source universal web crawler that uses the Chrome Debugging Protocol, enabling the use of the Blink browser engine for parsing, while obtaining protocol-level information. The crawler stores information in a database and on the file system and the implementation has been evaluated in a predictable environment to ensure correctness in the collected data. Additionally, it has been evaluated in a real-world scenario, demonstrating the impact of the parsing capabilities for data collection.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Panum, Thomas Kobber","Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Pedersen, Jens Myrup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-050881"],"event":{"end":"2019-06-21","place":"Paris , fr","start":"2019-06-19","title":"2019 Network Traffic Measurement and Analysis Conference (TMA)","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kraaler a user perspective web crawler","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85071198069&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-050881","identifier":[{"id":"85071198069","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-02e7c7cf-7877-4369-9da2-1ca2bf93f18d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-AD057840DC621B2B2203CE0C2747FEDC"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Wireless Communication Networks"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas Kobber","key":"panumpau","last":"Panum","locid":"b77e7d52-054f-4e99-a2fe-3965e283a4f8","name":"Panum, Thomas Kobber","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","name_org":"Hansen, René Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Myrup","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"dc8aaf34-ac43-4d00-8771-5cbdb8096039","name":"Pedersen, Jens Myrup","orcid":"0000-0002-1903-2921","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Stefano","key":"seccipedh","last":"Secci","name":"Secci, Stefano","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Isabelle","key":"chrismentpedh","last":"Chrisment","name":"Chrisment, Isabelle","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Marco","key":"fiorepedh","last":"Fiore","name":"Fiore, Marco","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Lionel","key":"tabourierpedh","last":"Tabourier","name":"Tabourier, Lionel","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Keun-Woo","key":"limpedh","last":"Lim","name":"Lim, Keun-Woo","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.23919/tma.2019.8784660","eisbn":["9783903176171"],"isbn":["9783903176171"],"pages":"153-160","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","status":"p","title":"2019 Network Traffic Measurement and Analysis Conference (TMA)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85071198069"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-02e7c7cf-7877-4369-9da2-1ca2bf93f18d"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Kraaler: A User-Perspective Web Crawler","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-050881","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Objectives: The primary aim of this study was to examine whether the mortality of patients with bipolar disorder has increased over the past two decades as compared with the background population. Methods: All patients registered with a bipolar disorder diagnosis in the Danish Psychiatric Research Registry from 1965 until the end of 2014, living in Denmark, alive and below the age of 65 years in the study period from 1995 to 2014 were included. Included patients reaching the age of 65 years during the study period were censored at that time point. Overall standardized mortality ratios (SMRs) were calculated for each calendar year over the study period, and trends in SMR over the study period were examined using linear regression. In addition, the SMRs were stratified according to age groups. Results: Patients with bipolar disorder had an overall elevated mortality rate relative to the general population with an SMR of 2.8, 95% confidence interval (CI): 2.8–2.9. The highest SMR was found among the youngest (15–29 years: 8.2, 95% CI: 6.7–10.1; 30–34 years: 7.7, 95% CI: 6.4–9.3; 35–39 years: 6.2, 95% CI: 5.4–7.2; 40–44 years: 4.6, 95% CI: 4.1–5.1; 45–49 years: 3.5, 95% CI: 3.3–3.8; 50–54 years: 3.2, 95% CI: 3.0–3.4; 55–59 years: 2.7, 95% CI: 2.6–2.8; and 60–64 years: 2.2, 95% CI: 2.1–2.3). An increase in SMR of 0.03 per year in patients diagnosed with bipolar disorder (P < 0.01) was found. Conclusions: The mortality gap between patients with bipolar disorder and the general Danish population has widened over the past two decades, which is a cause for concern, although reasons for the increasing mortality gap are unknown.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Staudt Hansen, Pernille","Laursen, Mathilde Frahm","Grøntved, Simon","Straszek, Sune Puggaard Vogt","Licht, Rasmus W","Nielsen, René Ernst"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-077746"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bipolar disorder","Epidemiology","Mortality"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"increasing mortality gap for patients diagnosed with bipolar disorder a nationwide study with 000000000020 years of follow up","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85051114043&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-077746","identifier":[{"id":"30051555","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85051114043","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-5f5d23e1-ca04-43b1-8c36-d8df29164e6c"],"keyword":["bipolar disorder","epidemiology","mortality"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6E439B4142BB1E1424A2F665F1D36A0E"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Psychiatry","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pernille","key":"staudthansenpau","last":"Staudt Hansen","locid":"28bb1812-9a73-4adf-bf85-3896596ee2be","name":"Staudt Hansen, Pernille","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mathilde","key":"frahmlaursenpau","last":"Frahm Laursen","locid":"ebb4f003-885a-4404-9331-9438c2921067","name":"Laursen, Mathilde Fra