{"abstract":"The photoluminescent properties of selected metal closo-boranes have been assessed. Group 3 elements Sc, Y, and La as well as Li, Na, and Eu-based B 10 H 10 2- and B 12 H 12 2- compounds displayed photoluminescence in the ultraviolet (emission λ max ≈ 350 nm) that was not visible to the human eye, in contrast to previous reports. We attribute these earlier results to arachno-borane impurities, which are more readily observed due to their longer wavelength emission spectra.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Paskevicius, Mark","Jakobsen, Anders Svarre","Bregnhøj, Mikkel","R. S. Hansen, Bjarne","Møller, Kasper Trans","Ogilby, Peter Remsen","Jensen, Torben René"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-190014"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Curtin University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"comment on bi functional li sub 000000000002 sub b sub 000000000012 sub h sub 000000000012 sub for energy storage and conversion applications solid state electrolyte and luminescent down conversion dye by j a teprovich jr h colón mercado a l washington ii p a ward s greenway d m missimer h hartman j velten j h christian and r zidan j mater chem a 000000002015 000000000003 000000022853 solid state electrolyte and luminescent down conversion dye by j a teprovich jr h colon mercado a l washington ii p a ward s greenway d m missimer h hartman j velten j h christian and r zidan j mater chem a 000000002015 000000000003 000000022853","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85061776624","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-190014","identifier":[{"id":"000459331600074","type":"wos"},{"id":"85061776624","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-6a5e3631-4151-49aa-8a05-061dab98d7ba"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-EA46882BEA9E74648846997C9FEBF5FD"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Chemistry","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center - INANO-Kemi, Langelandsgade"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"au","key":"curtin university","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"Curtin University","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mark","key":"paskeviciuspau","last":"Paskevicius","locid":"e26eea7d-e55a-4989-80de-dfafd2146511","name":"Paskevicius, Mark","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Svarre","key":"jakobsenpau","last":"Jakobsen","name":"Jakobsen, Anders Svarre","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mikkel","key":"bregnhøjpau","last":"Bregnhøj","locid":"60be394a-4fb2-4545-b2cc-42bc556a2abf","name":"Bregnhøj, Mikkel","orcid":"0000-0001-5748-6783","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bjarne Rosenlund Søndertoft","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"95e2932e-526e-4795-b38a-7ab221f891ae","name":"R. S. Hansen, Bjarne","name_org":"Hansen, Bjarne Ros