niversity of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Whole grain-rich diet reduces body weight and systemic low-grade inflammation without inducing major changes of the gut microbiome: a randomised cross-over trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-099.29-032620","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
