{"abstract":"In this paper, we present a performance study of the impact of generation and symbol sizes on latency for encoding with Random Linear Network Coding (RLNC). This analysis is important for low latency applications of RLNC as well as data storage applications that use large blocks of data, where the encoding process can be parallelized based on system requirements to reduce data access time within the system. Using a counting argument, we focus on predicting the effect of changes of generation (number of original packets) and symbol size (number of bytes per data packet) configurations on the encoding latency on full vector and on-the-fly algorithms. We show that the encoding latency doubles when either the generation size or the symbol size double and confirm this via extensive simulations. Although we show that the theoretical speed gain of on-the-fly over full vector is two, our measurements show a more moderate gain between 1.4 and 1.7, depending on the configuration used.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Lars","Hansen, René Rydhof","Lucani Rötter, Daniel Enrique"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-688000"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Data encoding","Performance benchmark","RLNC"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"latency performance of encoding with random linear network coding","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85050019638","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-688000","identifier":[{"id":"85050019638","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-93cc9d46-17cf-4d3c-9f14-d678493a5cd2"],"keyword":["Data encoding","Performance benchmark","RLNC"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-3-C5C5BDAE64DD430C951F5B8625370848"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University (AAU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Engineering, Department of Engineering - Electrical and Computer Engineering, Edison","Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Engineering, Department of Engineering - Electrical and Computer Engineering, Turing","Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Engineering, Department of Engineering - Network Computing, Communications and Storage"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Lars","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, René Rydhof","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Daniel Enrique","key":"lucanirötterpau","last":"Lucani Rötter","locid":"c4e78b1e-4dd6-460f-9c44-1a44771ce01a","name":"Lucani Rötter, Daniel Enrique","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9783800745609"],"isbn":["9783800745609"],"pages":"120-125","publisher":"VDE Verlag GMBH","publisher_org":"VDE Verlag GmbH","status":"p","subtitle":"24th European Wireless Conference","title":"24th European Wireless 2018 \"Wireless Futures in the Era of Network Programmability\", EW 2018"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85050019638"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-93cc9d46-17cf-4d3c-9f14-d678493a5cd2"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Latency Performance of Encoding with Random Linear Network Coding","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-688000","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Process calculi are a powerful mechanism to formally model distributed systems, and are especially useful for assessing trust, security, and privacy issues in mobile and ubiquitous computing and networking. However, they often only support a single modelling approach and semantics, whereas distributed systems and networks often are a conglomeration of different technologies and functionalities. In this paper we propose a novel approach to model these systems and make them amenable to formal analysis. We enhance the ambient calculus with 'wormholes' as a convenient way for ambients to travel between 'worlds' representing the different technologies and functionalities by means of different semantic layers. Our approach enables easy and natural modelling and analysis of multi-layer systems for ubiquitous computing and networking.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Probst, Christian W."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-114947"],"event":{"end":"2018-10-08","place":"Auckland, nz","start":"2018-10-05","title":"11th International Conference on Mobile Computing and Ubiquitous Network, ICMU 2018","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["OECD","Oceania"],"country":["New Zealand"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","UNITEC Institute of Technology"],"keyword":["Mobile computing","Overlay networks"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"modelling and analysing overlay networks by ambients with wormholes","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85063452824&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-114947","identifier":[{"id":"85063452824","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-df2c4243-eb78-4d67-907e-0425d54b707c"],"keyword":["Mobile communication architectures.","Mobile computing","Overlay networks"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-001A16597D1E10B566C235DEEB5CBD1C"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed, Embedded and Intelligent Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nz","key":"unitec institute of technology","loc":["New Zealand","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"UNITEC Institute of Technology","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rene Rydhof","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian W.","key":"probstpau","last":"Probst","name":"Probst, Christian W.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.23919/icmu.2018.8653596","eisbn":["9784907626341"],"publisher":"IEEE Signal Processing Society","series":"2018 11th International Conference on Mobile Computing and Ubiquitous Network, ICMU","status":"p","title":"2018 11th International Conference on Mobile Computing and Ubiquitous Network, ICMU 2018"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85063452824"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-df2c4243-eb78-4d67-907e-0425d54b707c"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Modelling and Analysing Overlay Networks by Ambients with Wormholes","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-114947","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Automatic cow identification becomes increasingly important for individual real time monitoring of production, health, behaviour etc., in modern dairy cattle production systems with large herd sizes. Examples of camera based classification of lameness (Viazzi et al., 2013) and conformation traits (Salau et al., 2017) have already been presented. The aim of this study was to identify cows individually at the feeding table using a 3D camera system (Patent no: WO 2017/001538). The purpose of this identification was, with use of the same 3D camera system, to measure the feed intake for the identified cow (Lassen et al., 2017). However, the cow-id identification can also be used in combination with other features. A 3D geometric cow model with corresponding cow-id was used as reference. All cows in this study were labelled with unique cow-id, making it possible to calculate the success rate for 3D cow-id identification system","author_count":8,"contributors":["Thomasen, Jørn Rind","Lassen, Jan","Gunner Brink Nielsen, Glenn","Borggard, Claus","Bolvig Stentebjerg, Peter René","Hjort Hansen, Rikke","Worsøe Hansen, Niels","Borchersen, Søren"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-142409"],"event":{"end":"2018-02-16","place":"Auckland, nz","start":"2018-02-11","title":"ICAR Conference and World Congress on Genetics Applied to Livestock Production 2018","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"individual cow identification in a commercial herd using 000000000003d camera technology","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.wcgalp.org/proceedings/2018/individual-cow-identification-commercial-herd-using-3d-camera-technology","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-142409","ids":["au-16967955-584d-4d86-974f-aa8f624450a5"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0DDED6C667E55DECE12DC2224D1FCB2B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.wcgalp.org/proceedings/2018/individual-cow-identification-commercial-herd-using-3d-camera-technology","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Center for Quantitative Genetics and Genomics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Viking Genetics"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Meat Research Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jørn Rind","key":"thomasenpau","last":"Thomasen","locid":"2ba5ebb2-970d-45ac-8c0c-82dd4970bde4","name":"Thomasen, Jørn Rind","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan","key":"lassenpau","last":"Lassen","locid":"ffdcc5c4-3edd-4724-bd31-9b3c117b45b1","name":"Lassen, Jan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Glenn","key":"gunnerbrinknielsenpau","l