s","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-8c66b11c-b376-49e3-9eb2-8ae7823db426"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Bone Structural Changes and Estimated Strength After Gastric Bypass Surgery Evaluated by HR-pQCT","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-613441","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
