{"abstract":"Four specimens in the sub-micrometre range and with different polishing were topographically investigated in fiveareas over their respective surfaces. Uncertainties were evaluated with and without correction for systematicbehaviour and successively analysed by a design of experiment (DOE). Results showed that the correction forsystematic behaviour allowed for a lower value of the estimated uncertainty when the correction was adequate tocompletely recognise the systematic effects. If not, the correction can produce an overestimation of the uncertainty.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Quagliotti, Danilo","Baruffi, Federico","Tosello, Guido","Gasparin, S.","Annoni, M.","Parenti, P.","Sobiecki, Rene","Hansen, Hans Nørgaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-352281"],"event":{"end":"2016-09-15","place":"Kgs. Lyngby, dk","start":"2016-09-13","title":"4M/IWMF 2016 Conference","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Polytechnic University of Milan"],"keyword":["DOE","Surface analysis","Systematic effects","Systematics","Topography"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-LEGO"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-LEGO","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"correction of systematic behaviour in topographical surface analysis","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/125898480/Proceedings_738.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-352281","ids":["dtu-9fe133de-2ccb-4048-9648-f6a83be4bf41"],"keyword":["DOE","Surface analysis","Systematic effects","Systematics","Topography"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-3-48F20849CB91F377CD132D7A6546B176"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/125898480/Proceedings_738.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Mechanical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Mechanical Engineering, Manufacturing Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"lego","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-LEGO","l3nn":"LEGO","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"LEGO","namevar":["Lego Group"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-LEGO","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"it","key":"polytechnic university of milan","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Polytechnic University of Milan","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Danilo","key":"quagliottipau","last":"Quagliotti","locid":"2abc1dc9-c1b1-4c94-9904-be78e2b9a3fd","name":"Quagliotti, Danilo","orcid":"0000-0002-8347-2884","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Federico","key":"baruffipau","last":"Baruffi","locid":"d5ca2074-1934-4833-9988-70638689035c","name":"Baruffi, Federico","orcid":"0000-0002-1799-7906","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Guido","key":"tosellopau","last":"Tosello","locid":"3e8b054c-7043-42aa-8b6c-57177bd403b6","name":"Tosello, Guido","orcid":"0000-0002-5071-7830","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"S.","key":"gasparinpau","last":"Gasparin","name":"Gasparin, S.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"M.","key":"annonipau","last":"Annoni","name":"Annoni, M.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"P.","key":"parentipau","last":"Parenti","name":"Parenti, P.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rene","key":"sobieckipau","last":"Sobiecki","locid":"61422ae6-8f15-4544-bfc4-4d4aa5669512","name":"Sobiecki, Rene","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hans Nørgaard","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"04ac6d96-df2f-44fb-a89e-7e76b5e460de","name":"Hansen, Hans Nørgaard","orcid":"0000-0001-7829-6962","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.3850/978-981-11-0749-8_738","isbn":["9789811107498"],"pages":"277-280","publisher":"Research Publishing Services","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 11th International Conference on Multi-Material Micro Manufacture (4M2016) : co-organised with 10th International Workshop on Microfactories (IWMF2016)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-9fe133de-2ccb-4048-9648-f6a83be4bf41"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Correction of systematic behaviour in topographical surface analysis","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-352281","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Carcinomas and their metastases often retain the keratin patterns of their epithelial origin, and are therefore useful as lineage-specific markers in diagnostic pathology. Recently, it has become clear that intermediate filaments composed by keratins play a role in modulation of cell proliferation, migration, and possibly cancer invasion, factors impacting prognosis in early stage non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC). MATERIAL AND METHODS: Tumor tissue from a retrospective Danish cohort of 177 patients with completely resected NSCLC, stage I-IIIA tumors, were analyzed for keratin 7 (K7) and keratin 34βE12 expression by immunohistochemistry and validated in a comparable independent Norwegian cohort of 276 stage I-IIIA NSCLC patients. RESULTS: Based on keratin 34βE12/K7 expression, three subgroups with significantly different median cancer-specific survival rates were identified (34βE12+/K7+, 168 months vs. 34βE12+/K7+, 73 months vs. 34βE12-/K7+, 30 months; p = 0.0004). In multivariate analysis, stage II-IIIA (HR 2.9), 34βE12+/K7+ (HR 1.90) and 34βE12-/K7+ (HR 3.7), were prognostic factors of poor cancer-specific survival (CSS) (p < 0.001). Validation in the Norwegian cohort confirmed that stage II-IIIA (HR 2.3), 34βE12+/K7+ (HR 1.6), and 34βE12-/K7+ (HR 2.0) were prognostic factors of poor CSS (p < 0.05). Multivariate Cox proportional-hazard analysis demonstrated that 34βE12+/K7 + and 34βE12+/K7 + status was significantly associated with poor overall survival (p < 0.05). CONCLUSION: Keratin 34βE12/K7 expression is a prognostic parameter in resected early stage NSCLC that allows identification of high-risk NSCLC patients with poor cancer-specific and overall survival.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Pøhl, Mette","Olsen, Karen Ege","Holst, René","Donnem, Tom","Busund, Lill-Tove","Bremnes, Roy M","Al-Saad, Samer","Andersen, Sigve","Richardsen, Elin","Ditzel, Henrik","Hansen, Olfred"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-607816"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","UiT The Arctic University of Norway","University Hospital of North Norway"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"keratin 000000000034betae000000000012 keratin000000000007 expression is a prognostic factor of cancer specific and overall survival in patients with early stage non small cell lung cancer","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/0284186X.2015.1049291","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-607816","identifier":[{"id":"26057535","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84961365857","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-78bf9367-e954-480d-b9ae-89e6a37b0e6c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-253290FE859E73787A5A1DC18D275DA0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/0284186X.2015.1049291","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Oncology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"no","key":"uit the arctic university of norway","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UiT The Arctic University of Norway","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"no","key":"university hospital of north norway","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University Hospital of North Norway","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette","key":"pøhlpau","last":"Pøhl","locid":"6e2a6d50-108e-4f53-85a1-313379d9a71b","name":"Pøhl, Mette","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Karen Ege","key":"olsenpau","last":"Olsen","locid":"d5fca320-8add-498f-84e5-80054d45cc66","name":"Olsen, Karen Ege","orcid":"0000-0002-6517-1172","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rene","key":"holstpau","last":"Holst","locid":"4e7351b7-b587-4782-a080-beefad358b0b","name":"Holst, René","name_org":"Holst, Rene","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Tom","key":"donnempau","last":"Donnem","name":"Donnem, Tom","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Lill-Tove","key":"busundpau","last":"Busund","name":"Busund, Lill-Tove","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Roy M","key":"bremnespau","last":"Bremnes","name":"Bremnes, Roy M","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Samer","key":"alsaadpau","last":"Al-Saad","name":"Al-Saad, Samer","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Sigve","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Sigve","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Elin","key":"richardsenpau","last":"Richardsen","name":"Richardsen, Elin","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik J","key":"ditzelpau","last":"Ditzel","locid":"f10637d7-ca3b-4956-a007-100f66737838","name":"Ditzel, Henrik","name_org":"Ditzel, Henrik J","orcid":"0000-0003-3927-5135","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Olfred","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"3c005a52-6edc-4112-b87b-e353b545a354","name":"Hansen, Olfred","orcid":"0000-0003-0396-1424","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26057535"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3109/0284186x.2015.1049291","issn":["0284186X","11001704"],"issn_org":["0284186X"],"issue":"2","journal":"Acta Oncologica","pages":"167-177","publisher":"Medical Journals Sweden AB","status":"p","title":"Acta Oncologica","volume":"55"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84961365857"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-78bf9367-e954-480d-b9ae-89e6a37b0e6c"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Keratin 34betaE12/keratin7 expression is a prognostic factor of cancer-specific and overall survival in patients with early stage non-small cell lung cancer","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-607816","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Hanne Riis Nielson and Flemming Nielson turned 60 in 2014 and 2015, respectively. Congratulations! To celebrate the 60th birthdays, and to honor the birthday children, a colloquium was held at the Technical University of Denmark on January 8, 2016, to deliver the Festschrift and presentations of most contributions as our birthday presents. This volume is dedicated to Hanne and Flemming and to their work. The Festschrift features contributions from colleagues who have worked together with Hanne and Flemming through their scientific life. We would like to thank all the contributors to this Festschrift — for their hard work, for their both scientifically interesting and individual articles, as well as for their enthusiasm to contribute. The mix of articles resembles very nicely the impressively wide area in which Hanne and Flemming have worked and made fundamental contributions. Both the Festschrift and the colloquium were a wonderful way to celebrate them. Our thanks also go to all the reviewers whose support made excellent articles even better. We are also indebted to Alfred Hofmann at Springer for his feedback and advice on our project, and to Anna Kramer from Springer for her fast responses to all our questions about Festschrifts and all matters around them.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Probst, Christian W.","Hankin, Chris","Hansen, Rene Rydhof"],"cuid":["S02-083.93-003565"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Imperial College London"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"semantics logics and calculi essays dedicated to hanne riis nielson and flemming nielson on the occasion of their 000000000060th birthdays","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84955290131","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-083.93-003565","identifier":[{"id":"84955290131","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-494b19de-a4c1-4836-a9fd-aac31dd74b42","dtu-81f756f3-7818-4bc0-90be-0cc9c154ee3d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-4-B4164791EA27A307FD3183E5DE30379E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"imperial college london","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Imperial College London","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed, Embedded and Intelligent Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian W.","key":"probstped","last":"Probst","locid":"6f0f045b-6369-4416-a241-c59d9214b6b4","name":"Probst, Christian W.","orcid":"0000-0002-4947-355X","rank":1,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Chris","key":"hankinped","last":"Hankin","name":"Hankin, Chris","rank":2,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rene Rydhof","key":"hansenped","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":3,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-319-27810-0","eisbn":["9783319278100"],"isbn":["9783319278094"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"344","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84955290131"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-494b19de-a4c1-4836-a9fd-aac31dd74b42","dtu-81f756f3-7818-4bc0-90be-0cc9c154ee3d"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Semantics, Logics, and Calculi : Essays Dedicated to Hanne Riis Nielson and Flemming Nielson on the Occasion of Their 60th Birthdays","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-083.93-003565","year":2016,"yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"In this study, we describe the isolation and characterisation of the novel enterobacteria phage CAjan. This phage belongs to the order Caudovirales and the family Siphoviridae. The phage possesses a linear, double-stranded DNA genome consisting of 59,670 bp with a G+C content of 44.7 % and 91 predicted open reading frames (ORFs). Putative functions were assigned to 39 of the ORFs (37.4 %). The phage structural genes were furthermore functionally characterised by LC MS/MS. CAjan, together with Escherichia phage Seurat and Escherichia phage slur01, represent a novel and genetically distinct clade of Siphoviridae phages that could be considered to constitute a new phage genus. Despite limited sequence similarity, the phages in this group share a number of other common features, including genome structure and the presence of queuosine biosynthesis genes.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Carstens, Alexander Byth","Kot, Witold","Lametsch, Rene","Neve, Horst","Hansen, Lars Hestbjerg"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-013701"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"characterisation of a novel enterobacteria phage cajan isolated from rat faeces","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84971627681","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-013701","identifier":[{"id":"000380135100015","type":"wos"},{"id":"84971627681","type":"scopus"},{"id":"27231007","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-0f4f1674-41e3-4c9b-88ee-f3a541edb38e","ku-f19848ea-4c00-4619-a535-f89f3f58fb2b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi"