{"abstract":"The plasmid-mediated colistin resistance gene, mcr-1, was detected in an Escherichia coli isolate from a Danish patient with bloodstream infection and in five E. coli isolates from imported chicken meat. One isolate from chicken meat belonged to the epidemic spreading sequence type ST131. In addition to IncI2*, an incX4 replicon was found to be linked to mcr-1. This report follows a recent detection of mcr-1 in E. coli from animals, food and humans in China.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Hasman, H.","Hammerum, A. M.","Hansen, F.","Hendriksen, Rene S.","Olesen, B.","Agersø, Yvonne","Zankari, Ea","Leekitcharoenphon, Pimlapas","Stegger, M.","Kaas, Rolf Sommer","Cavaco, Lina","Hansen, D. S.","Aarestrup, Frank Møller","Skov, R. L."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-374786"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Antimicrobial resistance","Bacterial Infections","Clinic","Denmark","Escherichia coli","Healthcare associated infections","Molecular methods","Multidrug resistance","Surveillance","Typing"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"detection of mcr 000000000001 encoding plasmid mediated colistin resistant escherichia coli isolates from human bloodstream infection and imported chicken meat denmark 000000002015","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2807/1560-7917.es.2015.20.49.30085","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-374786","identifier":[{"id":"84974785712","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-eaa43f58-b124-45f9-a5f0-eacf7094c1c0"],"keyword":["Denmark","Escherichia coli","antimicrobial resistance","bact