{"abstract":"Linguistic primitives for replica-aware coordination offer suitable solutions to the challenging problems of data distribution and locality in large-scale high-performance computing. The data replication mechanisms that had previously been designed to extend Klaim with replicated tuples are now used to experiment with X10, a parallel programming language primarily targeting clusters of multi-core processors linked in a large-scale system via high-performance networks. Our approach aims at allowing the programmer to specify and coordinate the replication of shared data items by taking into account the desired consistency properties. The programmer can hence exploit such flexible mechanisms to adapt data distribution and locality to the needs of the application, in order to improve performance in terms of concurrency and data access. We investigate issues related to replica consistency and provide a performance analysis, which includes scenarios where replica based specifications and relaxed consistency provide significant performance gains.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Andrić, Marina","De Nicola, Rocco","Lluch Lafuente, Alberto"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-375594"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","IMT Institute for Advanced Studies Lucca"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"replicating data for better performances in x000000000010","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84955300229","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-375594","identifier":[{"id":"84955300229","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-ed6ee65e-f875-41ad-822d-3a7d79fb915d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D6987605D6093D764A7143BA949B66F3"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"it","key":"imt institute for advanced studies lucca","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"IMT Institute for Advanced Studies Lucca","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Language-Based Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marina","key":"andrićpau","last":"Andrić","name":"Andrić, Marina","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rocco","key":"denicolapau","last":"De Nicola","name":"De Nicola, Rocco","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Alberto","key":"lluchlafuentepau","last":"Lluch Lafuente","locid":"8a0c36a1-ada1-4d08-9c86-3c67b5a4a401","name":"Lluch Lafuente, Alberto","orcid":"0000-0001-7405-0818","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Christian W.","key":"probstpedh","last":"Probst","name":"Probst, Christian W.","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenpedh","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, René Rydhof","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Chris","key":"hankinpedh","last":"Hankin","name":"Hankin, Chris","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-319-27810-0_12","eisbn":["9783319278100"],"isbn":["9783319278094"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"236-251","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","subtitle":"Essays Dedicated to Hanne Riis Nielson and Flemming Nielson on the Occasion of Their 60th Birthdays","title":"Semantics, Logics, and Calculi"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84955300229"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-ed6ee65e-f875-41ad-822d-3a7d79fb915d"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Replicating Data for Better Performances in X10","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-375594","year":"2015","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Testing stimulates learning, improves long-term retention, and promotes technical performance. No purpose-orientated test of competence in the theoretical aspects of VATS lobectomy has previously been presented. The purpose of this study was, therefore, to develop and gather validity evidence for a theoretical test on VATS lobectomy consisting of multiple-choice questions. METHODS: Four European VATS lobectomy experts were interviewed to explore their views on important theoretical VATS lobectomy knowledge (step 1). This information was used to construct the test items in compliance with existing guidelines for multiple-choice questions (step 2). The experts rated the relevance of the items to confirm content validity in a modified Delphi approach (step 3). Finally, the test was administered to physicians, who were categorised into different experience levels based on their experience in VATS procedures overall and in VATS lobectomies specifically. Their answers were used to achieve construct validity (step 4). RESULTS: Initially, 81 items were constructed and two Delphi iterations reduced the test to 50 items. Item analysis led to the exclusion of 19 items and the mean discrimination index of the 31 final items was 0.26. Cronbach's alpha for internal consistency was 0.75. The mean item difficulty was calculated to 0.63. According to performed VATS procedures, significantly different test performances were detected when comparing the group performances (p = 0.002) and the experts performed significantly better than the novices (p < 0.001) and intermediates (p = 0.01). In the category of performed VATS lobectomies, significant group performances were also found. In this category, the experts were also significantly better than the novices (p < 0.001), the trainees (p = 0.002), and the intermediates (p = 0.01). CONCLUSIONS: This study led to the development of a theoretical test on VATS lobectomy consisting of multiple-choice questions. Both content and construct validity evidence were established.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Savran, Mona M","Hansen, Henrik Jessen","Horsleben Petersen, René","Walker, William","Schmid, Thomas","Bojsen, Signe Rolskov","Konge, Lars"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-454273"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"development and validation of a theoretical test of proficiency for video assisted thoracoscopic surgery vats lobectomy","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-454273","identifier":[{"id":"84939486917","type":"scopus"},{"id":"25427417","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-65d8dc54-bef9-44f7-b5f0-4670230ed618"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CA5484A48B809586DF78A6DFAE761202"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person"