{"abstract":"NDIR is proposed for monitoring of air pollutants emitted by ship engines. Careful optical filtering overcomes the challenge of optical detection of NO2 in humid exhaust gas, despite spectroscopic overlap with the water vapour band. © 2014 OSA.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Stolberg-Rohr, Thomine Kirstine","Buchner, Rainer","Clausen, Sønnik","Møller Jensen, Jens","Skouboe, Allan","Hawkins, Gary J.","Skov Hansen, Rene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-366221"],"event":{"end":"2014-07-31","place":"Barcelona, es","start":"2014-07-27","title":"Optical Sensors 2014","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Reading"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Aarhus School of Marine and Technical Engineering"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-DFS"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-DFS","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"in optics humidity compensation in ndir exhaust gas measurements of no000000000002","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85087232984","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-366221","identifier":[{"id":"85087232984","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-ce848f99-c449-4204-b65d-dea8f4f2ed41"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-D03D46F9CB864C3AF57F1B3A3051416F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["T