{"abstract":"Attacks on systems and organisations increasingly exploit human actors, for example through social engineering, complicating their formal treatment and automatic identification. Formalisation of human behaviour is difficult at best, and attacks on socio-technical systems are still mostly identified through brainstorming of experts. In this work we formalize attack tree generation including human factors; based on recent advances in system models we develop a technique to identify possible attacks analytically, including technical and human factors. Our systematic attack generation is based on invalidating policies in the system model by identifying possible sequences of actions that lead to an attack. The generated attacks are precise enough to illustrate the threat, and they are general enough to hide the details of individual steps.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Ivanova, Marieta Georgieva","Probst, Christian","Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Kammüller, Florian"],"cuid":["S02-080.16-009650"],"event":{"end":"2015-08-25","place":"Heraklion, Crete, gr","start":"2015-08-24","title":"9th IFIP WG 11.2 International Conference on Information Security Theory and Practice (WISTP 2015)","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Middlesex University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"attack tree generation by policy invalidation","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/127237239/2015_IvanovaProbstHansenKammueller_AttackTreeGenerationByPolicyInvalidation_WISTP_75.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-080.16-009650","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000363799500016","type":"wos"},{"id":"84944686963","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-c8f74dbc-0632-477e-92ae-311382292638","dtu-afc02450-ae73-4d9a-9266-128d09e245fb"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-8A821F77861A6ACE54563DFAE87ABB2F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/127237239/2015_IvanovaProbstHansenKammueller_AttackTreeGenerationByPolicyInvalidation_WISTP_75.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Language-Based Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed Systems and Semantics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"middlesex university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Middlesex University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1",