{"author_count":6,"contributors":["Winkler, Laura Vad","Christiansen, Erik","Lichtenstein, Mia Beck","Beck Hansen, Nina","Bilenberg, Niels","Støving, René Klinkby"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-640425"],"event":{"end":"2015-01-17","place":"Odense, dk","start":"2015-01-16","title":"Annual meeting of the Danish Endocrine Society","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"quality of life in eating disorders a meta analysis","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-640425","ids":["sdu-eab376c1-66a4-4291-8c4c-5c510e0728e2"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-CB130DC5FA1277DB9E69709BD0893FB7"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Endocrinology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Laura Al-Dakhiel","key":"winklerpau","last":"Winkler","locid":"7b9b47e9-c528-4f6b-938a-a9d46af5c6fe","name":"Winkler, Laura Vad","name_org":"Winkler, Laura Al-Dakhiel","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Erik","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","name":"Christiansen, Erik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mia Beck","key":"lichtensteinpau","last":"Lichtenstein","locid":"2b24df11-a1e7-4a80-8355-6f2f633eaca6","name":"Lichtenstein, Mia Beck","orcid":"0000-0002-7885-9187","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nina","key":"beckhansenpau","last":"Beck Hansen","locid":"9e8ddeb7-5e9f-4dd2-bff8-ea0b98c03257","name":"Beck Hansen, Nina","orcid":"0000-0002-2962-3311","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels","key":"bilenbergpau","last":"Bilenberg","locid":"c865af0f-affd-44a4-b9fa-39c26141d3e2","name":"Bilenberg, Niels","orcid":"0000-0002-5838-556X","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René Klinkby","key":"støvingpau","last":"Støving","locid":"4aab81f6-352f-4c74-82a2-23589beb9fd5","name":"Støving, René Klinkby","orcid":"0000-0002-4255-5544","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-eab376c1-66a4-4291-8c4c-5c510e0728e2"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Quality of life in eating disorders: a meta-analysis","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-640425","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVES: To investigate the association between tobacco smoking and disease activity, treatment adherence and treatment responses among patients with psoriatic arthritis (PsA) initiating the first tumour necrosis factor α inhibitor therapy (TNFi) in routine care. METHODS: Observational cohort study based on the Danish nationwide DANBIO registry. Kaplan-Meier plots, logistic and Cox regression analyses by smoking status (current/previous/never smoker) were calculated for treatment adherence, ACR20/50/70-responses and EULAR-good-response. Additional stratified analyses were performed according to gender and TNFi-subtype (adalimumab/etanercept/infliximab). RESULTS: Among 1388 PsA patients included in the study, 1148 (83%) had known smoking status (33% current, 41% never and 26% previous smokers). Median follow-up time was 1.22 years (IQR 0.44-2.96). At baseline, current smokers had lower Body Mass Index (27 kg/m(2) (23-30)/28 kg/m(2) (24-31)) (median (IQR)), shorter disease duration (3 years (1-8)/5 years (2-10)), lower swollen joint count (2 (0-5)/3 (1-6)), higher visual-analogue-scale (VAS) patient global (72 mm (54-87)/68 mm (50-80)), VAS fatigue (72 mm (51-86)/63 mm (40-77)) and Health Assessment Questionnaire (HAQ) score (1.1 (0.7 to 1.5)/1.0 (0.5 to 1.5)) than never smokers (all p<0.05). Current smokers had shorter treatment adherence than never smokers (1.56 years (0.97 to 2.15)/2.43 years (1.88 to 2.97), (median (95% CI)), log rank p=0.02) and poorer 6 months' EULAR-good-response rates (23%/34%), ACR20 (24%/33%) and ACR50 response rates (17%/24%) (all p<0.05), most pronounced in men. In current smokers, the treatment adherence was poorer for infliximab (HR) 1.62, 95% CI 1.06 to 2.48) and etanercept (HR 1.74, 1.14 to 2.66) compared to never smokers, but not for adalimumab (HR 0.80, 0.52 to 1.23). CONCLUSION: In PsA, smokers had worse baseline patient-reported outcomes, shorter treatment adherence and poorer response to TNFi's compared to non-smokers. This was most pronounced in men and in patients treated with infliximab or etanercept.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Højgaard, Pil","Glintborg, Bente","Hetland, Merete Lund","Hansen, Torben Højland","Lage-Hansen, Philip Rask","Petersen, Martin H","Holland-Fischer, Mette","Nilsson, Christine","Loft, Anne Gitte","Andersen, Bjarne Nesgaard","Adelsten, Thomas","Jensen, Jørgen","Omerovic, Emina","Christensen, Regitse","Tarp, Ulrik","Ostgård, René","Dreyer, Lene"],"cuid":["S04-097.70-011868"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"OT":["Department of Rheumatology, Gentofte Hospital, Copenhagen, Denmark Department of Rheumatology, Frederiksberg Hospital, Copenhagen, Denmark."],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"association between tobacco smoking and response to tumour necrosis factor α inhibitor treatment in psoriatic arthritis results from the danbio registry","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/annrheumdis-2014-205389","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S04-097.70-011868","identifier":[{"id":"25063827","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84954364041","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000365846400013","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-f897e591-f442-487b-b180-cce986f34691","au-9f34a167-3a35-4403-a7c7-bd34237e7acb","ku-54c163d0-b9d2-4f2d-87a2-f5997ba0c207","sdu-585f8e31-c68a-4398-9f0d-ea441f7941a3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"n