{"abstract":"Valg af materiale/medie/form: Power Point Valg af arbejdsform: Workshop Begrundelse for valg af materiale/medie/form/arbejdsform: Power Point er et fortrinligt medie ved fremlægning af oplæg om VABB delprojekt 04 til en workshop","author_count":5,"contributors":["Nissen, Søren Bülow","Klitgaard, Anne","Beck, Frederikke","Hansen, Ole Gade","Jeppesen, René Dahl"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-651496"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Byggeri miljø og energi"],"level":"pop","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"oplæg om vabb delprojekt 000000000004 interorganisatorisk kompetencenetværk ved energioptimering af skoler","src":["ucn"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"doo","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-651496","ids":["ucn-874568f0-cf33-47e8-be98-4f8f5abae859"],"keyword":["Byggeri, miljø og energi"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","noi":["Local-1-1-A5BD5A8D32B8D4685C5DC6A5CDC1D566"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucn university college of northern denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCN","l3nl":"University College of Northern Denmark","l3nn":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen UCN, UCN Direktion, UCN Erhverv, Byggeriuddannelserne"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCN","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Bülow","key":"nissenoth","last":"Nissen","locid":"ba7a22b8-aca3-40ad-acab-da56167f0faa","name":"Nissen, Søren Bülow","rank":1,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne","key":"klitgaardoth","last":"Klitgaard","locid":"b79e67d7-666b-4689-9993-005d39850e67","name":"Klitgaard, Anne","orcid":"0000-0003-2232-6223","rank":2,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Frederikke","key":"beckoth","last":"Beck","locid":"8f631fe6-a98e-49da-b0fb-d4e5b7aea037","name":"Beck, Frederikke","orcid":"0000-0002-5897-2465","rank":3,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole Gade","key":"hansenoth","last":"Hansen","locid":"28d8a442-e71f-4da0-a1cf-4472c5564152","name":"Hansen, Ole Gade","rank":4,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René Dahl","key":"jeppesenoth","last":"Jeppesen","locid":"6dd80e8a-6228-43d4-a64c-1f7e240d5838","name":"Jeppesen, René Dahl","rank":5,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University College of Northern Denmark","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucn-874568f0-cf33-47e8-be98-4f8f5abae859"],"src":["UCN University College of Northern Denmark"],"title":"Oplæg om VABB delprojekt 04 : \"Interorganisatorisk kompetencenetværk ved energioptimering af skoler\"","type":"Other-Unknown","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-651496","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Attacks on a system often exploit vulnerabilities that arise from human behaviour or other human activity. Attacks of this type, so-called socio-technical attacks, cover everything from social engineering to insider attacks, and they can have a devastating impact on an unprepared organisation. In this paper we develop an approach towards modelling socio-technical systems in general and socio-technical attacks in particular, using timed automata and illustrate its application by a complex case study. Thanks to automated model checking and automata theory, we can automatically generate possible attacks in our model and perform analysis and simulation of both model and attack, revealing details about the specific interaction between attacker and victim. Using timed automata also allows for intuitive modelling of systems, in which quantities like time and cost can be easily added and analysed.","author_count":7,"contributors":["David, Nicolas","David, Alexandre","Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","Legay, Axel","Olesen, Mads Chr.","Probst, Christian"],"cuid":["S02-090.09-784748"],"event":{"end":"2015-10-16","place":"Denver, Colorado, us","start":"2015-10-12","title":"7th ACM CCS International Workshop on Managing Insider Security Threats (MIST '15)","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["France"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","French National Institute for Computer Science and Applied Mathematics","Inria","Nantes Université","University of Nantes"],"keyword":["Attack trees","Insider threats","Timed automata"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"modelling social technical attacks with timed automata","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84956631899","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-090.09-784748","identifier":[{"id":"84956631899","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-056c1bc0-f89a-434b-85b0-4783516633e9","dtu-7c40dcc8-57a2-4664-b8b5-5bfc989fc3ce"],"keyword":["Attack generation","Attack trees","Insider threats","Timed automata"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-516746CF53DC1E203D5216ECD4FB49B5"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"fr","key":"nantes université","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Nantes Université","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"fr","key":"university of nantes","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Nantes","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Distributed Systems and Semantics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"fr","key":"inria","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Inria","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"fr","key":"french national institute for computer science and applied mathematics","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"French National Institute for Computer Science and Applied Mathematics","used":1},{"affno":"6","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Language-Based Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Nicolas","key":"davidnicolaspau","last":"David","name":"David, Nicolas","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Alexandre","key":"davidalexandrepau","last":"David","locid":"19ebed27-7490-4dd9-b95a-cb134a41261a","name":"David, Alexandre","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rene Rydhof","key":"hansenrenerydhofpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d92ec90d-a8b7-4c01-acbe-ebab21f3f0c3","name":"Hansen, Rene Rydhof","orcid":"0000-0002-5688-6432","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kim Guldstrand","key":"larsenkimguldstrandpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"27dbc400-17ea-4672-9343-63093ad486c9","name":"Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","orcid":"0000-0002-5953-3384","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4 5","corresponding":null,"first":"Axel","key":"legayaxelpau","last":"Legay","name":"Legay, Axel","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mads Chr.","key":"olesenmadschrpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"c2e63d48-efc8-4e23-9dbf-509a20de7dc3","name":"Olesen, Mads Chr.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian W.","key":"probstchristianwpau","last":"Probst","locid":"6f0f045b-6369-4416-a241-c59d9214b6b4","name":"Probst, Christian W.","orcid":"0000-0002-4947-355X","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/2808783.2808787","isbn":["9781450338325","9781450338240"],"pages":"21-28","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery (ACM)","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 7th ACM CCS International Workshop on Managing Insider Security Threats"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84956631899"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-056c1bc0-f89a-434b-85b0-4783516633e9","dtu-7c40dcc8-57a2-4664-b8b5-5bfc989fc3ce"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Modelling Social-Technical Attacks with Timed Automata","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-090.09-784748","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE:: To test a hypothesized association between resting leptin levels (adjusted for body fat percentage) and symptoms of primary exercise addiction. DESIGN:: Cross-sectional design. SETTING:: Habitual amateur exercisers participating in running, fitness, weight training, and biking. PARTICIPANTS:: Twenty men with exercise addiction as defined by the Exercise Addiction Inventory (EAI scores 24-30) and 20 men in an exercise control group (EAI scores 6-16) matched on body mass index. MAIN OUTCOME MEASURES:: Plasma leptin and sex hormones were measured in blood samples collected under fasting and resting conditions. Body composition was assessed by dual-energy x-ray absorptiometry. Eating disorder symptoms were identified by the Eating Disorder Inventory 2. RESULTS:: The exercise addiction group had significantly (P < 0.001) lower leptin levels (1.1 μg/L, SD = 1.3) than controls (4.3 μg/L, SD = 2.9). Even when adjusted for body fat percentage, the addiction group had significantly (P < 0.001) lower leptin levels (0.1 μg/L, SD = 0.1) than the controls (0.2 μg/L, SD = 0.1). Body fat-adjusted leptin correlated with free bioavailable testosterone, but it was only significant in nonaddictive exercisers. None of the exercisers seemed to suffer from an eating disorder. CONCLUSIONS:: This is the first study showing that excessive training in exercise addiction is associated with low levels of body fat-adjusted leptin levels. CLINICAL RELEVANCE:: Hypoleptinemia could be involved in the pathogenesis of exercise addiction. However, further studies are needed to explore the potential causal relationship.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Lichtenstein, Mia B","Andries, Alin","Hansen, Stinus","Frystyk, Jan","Støving, René K"],"cuid":["S02-098.87-017530"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Absorptiometry Photon","Adult","Behavior Addictive","Body composition","Case Control Studies","Cross Sectional Studies","Exercise","Exercise addiction","Humans","Leptin","Linear Models","Male","Middle Aged","Testosterone","Young Adult","eating disorder symptoms"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"exercise addiction in men is associated with lower fat adjusted leptin levels","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1097/JSM.0000000000000110","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-098.87-017530","identifier":[{"id":"84924624290","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24926913","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-42b0b9e6-6df5-410e-8ee2-5ec346eb841b","sdu-be63b0be-ab91-40bc-8f89-ee7fed1b4cb3"],"keyword":["Absorptiometry, Photon","Adult","Behavior, Addictive","Body Composition","Case-Control Studies","Cross-Sectional Studies","Exercise","Exercise addiction","Humans","Leptin","Linear Models","Male","Middle Aged","Testosterone","Young Adult","eating disorder symptoms"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-8BB780E5543588CBCC84BB006B64AD5E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1097/JSM.0000000000000110","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, Research Unit of Child and Adolescent Psychiatry (Southern Denmark)","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Depa