","volume":"25"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84924624290"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-42b0b9e6-6df5-410e-8ee2-5ec346eb841b","sdu-be63b0be-ab91-40bc-8f89-ee7fed1b4cb3"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Exercise Addiction in Men Is Associated With Lower Fat-Adjusted Leptin Levels","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-098.87-017530","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
