{"abstract":"The ZigBee protocol is a large and complicated standard with multiple abstraction layers, and it is a substantial undertaking for new players in the field. The purpose of this project is to enable Zigbee networking for a non-ZigBee device, such as the ConLAN keypad. To accomplish this we utilise the existing tool, Homeport, to act as a middleware and bridge between ConLAN's existing network and the ZigBee network. This report primarily discusses three possible solutions for constructing this bridge and current status on the implementation of a Develco SmartAMM and Zigbee stack for HomePort.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Pedersen, Thomas","Smedegaard, Jacob Haubach","Hansen, Rene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-052647"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Home automation","ZigBee"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"homeport zigbee adapter internal milestone report","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/206845988/Develco_ZigBee_Adapter.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-052647","ids":["aau-08ef37ff-3ac4-47a5-95df-d87f78417171"],"keyword":["Home Automation","HomePort","SmartAMM","ZigBee"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-5277144EFC97D9DC52509D22BEF30976"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/206845988/Develco_ZigBee_Adapter.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalbo