{"abstract":"The Certifiable Java for Embedded Systems (CJ4ES) project aimed to develop a prototype development environment and platform for safety-critical software for embedded applications. There are three core constituents: A profile of the Java programming language that is tailored for safety-critical applications, a predictable Java processor built with FPGA technology, and an Eclipse based application development environment that binds the profile and the platform together and provides analyses that help to provide evidence that can be used as part of a safety case. This paper summarizes key contributions within these areas during the three-year project period. In the conclusion the overall result of the project is assessed.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Schoeberl, Martin","Hansen, René Rydhof","Ravn, Anders P.","Dalsgaard, Andreas Engelbredt","Rivas, Juan Ricardo Rios","Strøm, Tórur Biskopstø","Korsholm, Stephan Erbs","Søndergaard, Hans"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-655984"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Programming","Safety critical Java"],"level":"sci","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"certifiable java for embedded systems","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-655984","identifier":[{"id":"84937794867","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["via-275d6f7c-3ee8-4a38-87c1-d6634a46088f"],"keyword":["Safety-Critical Java","programming"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-233E9F14D8D5D1E22F4F9887C62590C9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Uddannelser, Ingeniør- og businessuddannelserne, Software Technology Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"schoeberlpau","last":"Schoeberl","name":"Schoeberl, Martin","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, René Rydhof","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders P.","key":"ravnpau","last":"Ravn","name":"Ravn, Anders P.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Andreas Engelbredt","key":"dalsgaardpau","last":"Dalsgaard","name":"Dalsgaard, Andreas Engelbredt","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Juan Ricardo Rios","key":"rivaspau","last":"Rivas","name":"Rivas, Juan Ricardo Rios","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tórur Biskopstø","key":"strømpau","last":"Strøm","name":"Strøm, Tórur Biskopstø","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stephan Erbs","key":"korsholmpau","last":"Korsholm","locid":"4a03c6b3-a600-4614-850c-cf3abcdf20d2","name":"Korsholm, Stephan Erbs","orc