 Lars Bang","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9783943365153"],"pages":"105-133","place":"Berlin","publisher":"Sternberg Press","status":"p","title":"The phantom of liberty. Contemporary art and the pedagogical paradox"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-315323ce-20c0-4fe1-840f-6bbccfd8b9ae"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"ADHD: The Pathologization and Medicalization of Active/Restless Boys in Highly Individualized Late-Modern Societies?","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-157534","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"X-ray diffraction is a superior technique for structural characterization of crystalline matter. Here we review the use of in situ powder X-ray diffraction (PXD) mainly for real-time studies of solid/gas reactions, data analysis and the extraction of valuable knowledge of structural, chemical and physical properties. Furthermore, the diffraction data may also provide knowledge on reaction mechanisms, kinetics and thermodynamic properties. Thus, in situ PXD simultaneously provides properties as a function of pressure, temperature and/or time at different length scales, i.e. nanoscale structural data and bulk sample properties. Initially, a brief description of experimental and methodological details is provided, followed by a variety of examples of different designs of experiments and methods of data analysis. Additionally, it is discussed how a range of physical properties can be accessed by diffraction techniques, e.g. crystallite size. The aim of this review is to provide new inspiration for utilization of in situ PXD for characterization of a wide range of properties beyond the scope of crystal structure solution.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Møller, Kasper Trans","R. S. Hansen, Bjarne","Dippel, Ann-Christin","Jørgensen, Jens-Erik","Jensen, Torben René"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-212867"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Helmholtz Association of German Research Centres"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"characterization of gas solid reactions using in situ powder x ray diffraction","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/84241790/ZAAC_Published.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-212867","identifier":[{"id":"84916620354","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-928a92b4-5c2c-46bd-8cbd-7ccc71ebc61f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E2E061417CD206B15360AAE4001DDF74"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/84241790/ZAAC_Published.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/zaac.201400262","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Chemistry, Department of Chemistry - Centre for Materials Crystallography (CMC)","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center - INANO-Kemi, Langelandsgade"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"helmholtz association of german research centres","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Helmholtz Association of German Research Centres","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kasper Trans","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"a0126e94-4bb1-46c4-9692-5269054851d7","name":"Møller, Kasper Trans","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bjarne Rosenlund Søndertoft","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"95e2932e-526e-4795-b38a-7ab221f891ae","name":"R. S. Hansen, Bjarne","name_org":"Hansen, Bjarne Rosenlund Søndertoft","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Ann-Christin","key":"dippelpau","last":"Dippel","name":"Dippel, Ann-Christin","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}