{"abstract":"System models have recently been introduced to model organisations and evaluate their vulnerability to threats and especially insider threats. Especially for the latter these models are very suitable, since insiders can be assumed to have more knowledge about the attacked organisation than outside attackers. Therefore, many attacks are considerably easier to be performed for insiders than for outsiders. However, current models do not support explicit specification of different behaviours. Instead, behaviour is deeply embedded in the analyses supported by the models, meaning that it is a complex, if not impossible task to change behaviours. Especially when considering social engineering or the human factor in general, the ability to use different kinds of behaviours is essential. In this work we present an approach to make the behaviour a separate component in system models, and explore how to integrate in existing models.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Ivanova, Marieta Georgieva","Probst, Christian W.","Hansen, René Rydhof","Kammuller, Florian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-338116"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Middlesex University"],"keyword":["Human behaviour","Static analysis","System models"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"externalizing behaviour for analysing system models","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/101144753/jisis_2013_vol3_no34_05.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-338116","ids":["dtu-706089cb-a639-4a3d-83ea-9933fcbcc2de"],"keyword":["human behaviour","static analysis","system models"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-E17F619B55224D4BB825DFAA920F279C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/101144753/jisis_2013_vol3_no34_05.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Language-Based Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"middlesex university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Middlesex University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Marieta Georgieva","key":"ivanovapau","last":"Ivanova","locid":"c74400a7-13c0-4665-acae-fa6a428ddff3","name":"Ivanova, Marieta Georgieva","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian W.","key":"probstpau","last":"Probst","locid":"6f0f045b-6369-4416-a241-c59d9214b6b4","name":"Probst, Christian W.","orcid":"0000-0002-4947-355X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"René Rydhof","key":"hansenpau","last":"Han