{"abstract":"Denne rapport indeholder en beskrivelse af arbejdet udført i og resultaterne af forsknings- og udviklingsprojektet ” Udvikling af CO2 neutralt byrumsarmatur” og udgør slutrapportering for dette projekt.","author_count":23,"contributors":["Poulsen, Peter Behrensdorff","Dam-Hansen, Carsten","Corell, Dennis Dan","Thorseth, Anders","Thorsteinsson, Sune","Hansen, Søren Stentoft","Wolff, Jesper","Ellermann, Stine","Bak, Christian","Skrzypinski, Witold Robert","Beller, Christina","Kock, Carsten Weber","Bühler, Fabian","Harboe, René Kirstein","Boesgaard, Per","Jensen, Tim","Søndergaard, Ole","Andresen, Christian","Fahlén, Morten","Maare, Thomas","Prestegaard, Hugo","Poulsen, Jan","Kremmer, Susanne"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-347777"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Gate 21"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH","DI-PR-ØR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-PR-ØR","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"udvikling af co000000000002 neutralt byrumsarmatur slutrapport","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/54061706/343-021_Final%20Report_Development%20CO2%20neutral%20hybrid%20street%20lighting.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-347777","ids":["dtu-90d72506-4105-406f-a9df-0773a74d833c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A8283A162A64D1B8893AE320E6AB6FB0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.elforsk.dk/Elforsk/Projekter/ProjectSearch/ProjektInfo.aspx?proji=343-021","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/54061706/343-021_Final%20Report_Development%20CO2%20neutral