{"abstract":"This paper describes SmartCampusAAU - an open, extendable platform that supports the easy creation of indoor location based systems. SmartCampusAAU offers an app and backend that can be used to enable indoor positioning and navigation in any building. The SmartCampusAAU app is available on all major mobile platforms (Android, iPhone and Windows Phone) and supports both device- and infrastructure-based positioning. SmartCampusAAU also offers a publicly available OData backend that allows researchers to share radio map and location tracking data.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Hansen, Rene","Thomsen, Bent","Thomsen, Lone Leth","Adamsen, Filip Stubkjær"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-121613"],"event":{"acronym":"MDM","end":"2013-06-06","place":"Milan, it","start":"2013-06-03","title":"the 14th IEEE International Conference on Mobile Data Management","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"smartcampusaau an open platform enabling indoor positioning and navigation","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/MDM.2013.62","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-121613","identifier":[{"id":"84883505320","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-f63aa756-47cc-4563-a7fa-93d203970672"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5B8D021FE41859012781481A5E1272B4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/stamp/stamp.jsp?tp=&arnumber=6569059&isnumber=6569035","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/MDM.2013.62","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra