{"abstract":"Når kommuner øger sikkerhed og komfort på cykelstierne stiger antallet af cykelpendlere. Og det er en stor samfundsgenvinst, viser et nyt forskningsprojekt. Cykelpendlere sparer tid og penge, forbedrer helbredet og øger livskvaliteten.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Hansen, Karsten Rene Bruun","Nielsen, Thomas Alexander Sick"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-339271"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cykel motorveje kan være hurtigere end motorveje i myldretiden","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.ktc.dk/teknik-miljoe/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-339271","ids":["dtu-744eb10c-90e3-4140-957d-c04980e7c343"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D985EC83C10DA2497357546943003784"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.ktc.dk/teknik-miljoe/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Transport","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Transport