,"All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-75cafbd3-01c0-43cd-8f46-2414ca861381"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Gene-Based Analysis of Regionally Enriched Cortical Genes in GWAS Data Sets of Cognitive Traits and Psychiatric Disorders","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-463885","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
