{"abstract":"This study investigated symptoms of eating disorder, depression, and anxiety among Roux-en-Y gastric bypass patients two years after surgery, and the relationship between these characteristics and weight loss. Respondents completed assessment questionnaires including Eating Disorder Inventory-2 (EDI-2), Harvard Anxiety and Depression Scale (HADS), and questions related specifically to binge eating. Forty-five patients (8 men, 37 women) out of 65 (67%) responded. Scores were significant higher on impulse regulation, interoceptive awareness, ineffectiveness, maturity fears and interpersonal distrust in comparison with a Danish norm group (p≤0.05). The weight losses obtained after surgery varied from 12 to 60% of the starting weights. Binge eating and ineffectiveness were found to significantly correlate with weight loss variations after surgery (p≤0.05). The results of this study indicate that knowledge of the potential influence of eating disorder symptoms on outcomes after bariatric surgery is needed in order to optimize weight outcomes following surgery.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Beck, Nina N","Mehlsen, Mimi Yung","Støving, René Klinkby"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-025451"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"psychological characteristics and associations with weight outcomes two years after gastric bypass surgery postoperative eating disorder symptoms are associated with weight loss outcomes","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eatbeh.2012.06.001","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-025451","identifier":[{"id":"23121796","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84868336717","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-af8924b4-c597-4c4e-9b50-e494f7d1e6c5","sdu-38334c64-4807-4730-a7fa-f276b74df4c5"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-ACFE49FFA5099C2E52CF81068B8FDFBB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eatbeh.2012.06.001","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Psychology, The National Center of Psychotraumatology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Psychology and Behavioural Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nina Nonboe","key":"beckpau","last":"Beck","locid":"9e8ddeb7-5e9f-4dd2-bff8-ea0b98c03257","name":"Beck Hansen, Nina","name_org":"Beck, Nina Nonboe","orcid":"0000-0002-2962-3311","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mimi","key":"mehlsenpau","last":"Mehlsen","locid":"4d75aa04-7410-4597-9d07-685c5ab6cd30","name":"Mehlsen, Mimi Yung","name_org":"Mehlsen, Mimi","orcid":"0000-0001-5820-8937","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René Klinkby","key":"støvingpau","last":"Støving","locid":"4aab81f6-352f-4c74-82a2-23589beb9fd5","name":"Støving, René Klinkby","orcid":"0000-0002-4255-5544","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23121796"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.eatbeh.2012.06.001","issn":["14710153","18737358"],"issn_org":["14710153"],"issue":"4","journal":"Eating Behaviors","pages":"394-397","publisher":"Elsevier Ltd","status":"p","title":"Eating Behaviors","volume":"13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84868336717"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-af8924b4-c597-4c4e-9b50-e494f7d1e6c5","sdu-38334c64-4807-4730-a7fa-f276b74df4c5"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Psychological characteristics and associations with weight outcomes two years after gastric bypass surgery : Postoperative eating disorder symptoms are associated with weight loss outcomes","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-025451","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"author_count":9,"contributors":["Nielsen, Thomas Kollin","Polanski, Marek","R. S. Hansen, Bjarne","Tolborg, Søren","Ravnsbæk, Dorthe Bomholdt","Besenbacher, Flemming","Bystrzycki, Jerzy","Skibsted, Jørgen","Jensen, Torben René"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-197515"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Poland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Military University of Technology Warsaw"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"improved hydrogen storage kinetics of nanoconfined libh sub 000000000004 sub mgh sub 000000000002 sub reactive hydride composites catalyzed with nickel nanoparticles","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1557/opl.2012.1189","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-197515","identifier":[{"id":"84880519071","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-773d4e70-d415-49cb-b9a8-08d0ec199dd6"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-7D882822C7B29006FF2DB62D43DD16BD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1557/opl.2012.1189","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Faculty of Science, Department of Chemistry","Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Faculty of Science, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"pl","key":"military univers