{"author_count":2,"contributors":["Hansen, Henrik Jessen","Petersen, René Horsleben"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-469512"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a video atlas of video assisted thoracoscopic lobectomy using a standardized three port anterior approach","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-469512","identifier":[{"id":"23977476","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC3741703","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-7f135ae1-7df1-44a3-b9c8-3475ee5c4e5d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-EBE3383D4C3653E63AEB09A7DB5605FB"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik J","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"b356d6b1-e9df-41d2-8001-e4fa6cc000e3","name":"Hansen, Henrik Jessen","name_org":"Hansen, Henrik J","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"René H","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"aa18983b-8811-4b3a-a7bd-b439cc52d3e3","name":"Petersen, René Horsleben","name_org":"Petersen, René H","orcid":"0000-0002-3586-1869","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23977476"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3978/j.issn.2225-319x.2012.04.19","issn":["2225319X"],"issue":"1","journal":"Annals of Cardiothoracic Surgery","pages":"104","status":"p","title":"Annals of Cardiothoracic Surgery","volume":"1"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-7f135ae1-7df1-44a3-b9c8-3475ee5c4e5d"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A video-atlas of video-assisted thoracoscopic lobectomy using a standardized three-port anterior approach","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-469512","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"PURPOSE: Bevacizumab and chemotherapy is a common choice for first-line treatment of metastatic colorectal cancer (mCRC). So far, no predictive markers have been identified. The aim was to investigate the possible predictive value of single nucleotide polymorphisms (SNPs) in the vascular endothelial growth factor (VEGF) system in this setting. METHODS: Pre-treatment blood samples and response evaluations were available from 218 of the 249 included patients. All patients received bevacizumab and chemotherapy comprising fluorouracil and leucovorin or capecitabine combined with either oxaliplatin (FOLFOX or XELOX, n = 183) or irinotecan (FOLFIRI or XELIRI, n = 66). Germline DNA was isolated from whole blood, and five SNPs in the VEGF-A gene, one SNP in the VEGF receptor 1 (VEGFR-1) gene and three SNPs in the VEGFR-2 gene were analysed by polymerase chain reaction. Response was evaluated according to RECIST version 1.0, and the association to genotypes was analysed using Fisher's exact test. RESULTS: The VEGFR-1 319 C/A SNP was significantly associated with response. Objective response was observed in 36% of the patients with CC genotype, 40% with CA and 56% with AA, p = 0.048. The response rates also differed significantly between patients with C-allele containing genotypes (CC + CA) (39%) and patients homozygous for the A-allele (AA) (56%), p = 0.015. There was no correlation between response rates and the remaining SNPs. CONCLUSIONS: The VEGFR-1 319 C/A SNP is a potential predictive marker for bevacizumab plus chemotherapy in patients with mCRC. Patients with the A allele appeared to have increased response rates. The results call for validation.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Hansen, Torben Frøstrup","Christensen, René dePont","Andersen, Rikke Fredslund","Spindler, Karen-Lise Garm","Johnsson, Anders","Jakobsen, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-603271"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the predictive value of single nucleotide polymorphisms in the vegf system to the efficacy of first line treatment with bevacizumab plus chemotherapy in patients with metastatic colorectal cancer results from the nordic act trial","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00384-011-1382-6","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-603271","identifier":[{"id":"22139032","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84864444473","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-690fa60e-50b2-4220-9713-85b0290bef74"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B23EBCDDA23F3CFB3BD7C0A3D738608F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00384-011-1382-6","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, IRS - Lillebælt Hospital, Research Unit of Oncology (Vejle)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Torben Frøstrup","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"72d28643-c440-4bbd-ad2b-eef0903a9438","name":"Hansen, Torben Frøstrup","orcid":"0000-0001-7476-671X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"René Depont","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"3f33c4f0-abcb-42c6-85af-2d24bcf025ff","name":"Christensen, René dePont","name_org":"Christensen, René Depont","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rikke Fredslund","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"e82f9773-7004-444a-8176-b55f6342dd3d","name":"Andersen, Rikke Fredslund","orcid":"0000-0002-5894-7745","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Karen-Lise Garm","key":"spindlerpau","last":"Spindler","locid":"37487fed-3265-42bb-af0c-fdcf6153344e","name":"Spindler, Karen-Lise Garm","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"johnssonpau","last":"Johnsson","name":"Johnsson, Anders","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"jakobsenpau","last":"Jakobsen","locid":"6c772581-e8fe-48bc-a932-1d1c5122c25a","name":"Jakobsen, Anders","orcid":"0000-0003-2110-2615","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["22139032"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s00384-011-1382-6","issn":["01791958","14321262"],"issn_org":["14321262"],"issue":"6","journal":"International Journal of Colorectal Disease","pages":"715-720","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Colorectal Disease","volume":"27"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84864444473"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-690fa60e-50b2-4220-9713-85b0290bef74"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"The predictive value of single nucleotide polymorphisms in the VEGF system to the efficacy of first-line treatment with bevacizumab plus chemotherapy in patients with metastatic colorectal cancer : Results from the Nordic ACT trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-603271","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
