{"abstract":"Patients with upper gastrointestinal cancers have a poor prognosis and only few treatment options. The epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR) and vascular endothelial growth factor (VEGF) are valid targets in many solid tumours, and they have synergistic effects in preclinical studies.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Rohrberg, Kristoffer S","Olesen, René K","Pfeiffer, Per","Ladekarl, Morten","Pappot, Helle","Christensen, Ib Jarle","Høyer-Hansen, Gunilla","Sørensen, Morten","Skov, Birgit Guldhammer","Buysschaert, Ian","Carmeliet, Peter","Lassen, Ulrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-672214"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Angiogenesis Inhibitors","Antibodies Monoclonal Humanized","Carcinoma","Disease Free Survival","Dose Response Relationship Drug","Drug Resistance Neoplasm","Drug Therapy Combination","Female","Follow Up Studies","Gastrointestinal Neoplasms","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Prospective Studies","Quinazolines","Receptor Epidermal Growth Factor","Survival Analysis","Treatment Outcome"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-OTH"],"OT":["Onkologisk Afdeling D, NBG"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-OTH","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"phase ii trial of erlotinib and bevacizumab in patients with advanced upper gastrointestinal cancers","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/0284186X.2011.619568","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-672214","identifier":[{"id":"22017239","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84856462139","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-730a3b32-85ba-4e7e-93f4-9bf1da1de60f"],"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Angiogenesis Inhibitors","Antibodies, Monoclonal, Humanized","Carcin