{"abstract":"The preliminary result of using a high-power light emitting diode, LED, for photoacoustic imaging is presented. The pulsed light source is created by a 1Watt red Luxeon LED. The LED delivers light pulses with 25W peak power when supplied by 40A peak, 60ns wide current pulses. The phantom used for the experiment consists of a 3mm high x 5mm wide slice of green colored gelatine overlaid by a 3cm layer of colorless gelatine. The light pulses from the LED is focused on the green gelatine. The photoacoustic response from the green gelatine is detected by a single transducer on the opposite (top) surface of the colorless gelatine layer.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Hansen, René Skov"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-629905"],"event":{"end":"2011-02-17","place":"Lake Buena Vista (Orlando), us","start":"2011-02-12","title":"SPIE Medical Imaging 2011, Ultrasonic Imaging, Tomography, and Therapy","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Photoacoustic"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"using high power light emitting diodes for photoacoustic imaging","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-629905","ids":["sdu-c5efb630-9957-11df-846a-000ea68e967b"],"keyword":["Foto akustik","Photoacoustic"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-BE30FD3CC19F7A2BB1AF81589212D320"],"org":[{"affno":1,"key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Institute of Sensors, Signals and Electrotechnics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"René Skov","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"2b8ce6bc-5f10-426f-8ed8-30741934ca95","name":"Hansen, René Skov","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-c5efb630-9957-11df-846a-000ea68e967b"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Using high-power light emitting diodes for photoacoustic imaging","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-629905","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
