{"abstract":"Polishing is the final processing steps in many high precision applications as for example bearings, moulds and dies. The paper describes a new robot assisted polishing (RAP) machine and the characterization techniques employed to measure the polished surfaces. Focus is given to the comparison of different measuring principles applied to polished surfaces. Finally the progression of the surface topography during RAP polishing is investigated and documented.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Hansen, Hans Nørgaard","Gasparin, Stefania","Sobiecki, Rene","Grønbæk, J.","Lazarev, R."],"cuid":["S02-089.66-033781"],"event":{"end":"2011-04-15","place":"Twickenham, gb","start":"2011-04-12","title":"13th International Conference on Metrology and Properties of Engineering Surfaces","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Polishing","Surface roughness","Traceability"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"characterization of ultra fine surfaces produced by robot assisted polishing","src":["dtu","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-089.66-033781","ids":["dtu-357d8ee4-0643-481a-99e1-f609e910310b","sdu-fc03fb0f-6366-4d0b-bbc2-b8b3f4e1a0ba"],"keyword":["Polishing","Surface roughness","Traceability"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-140215C25D48E47D0A6F6F2E1141BF9F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Mechanical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Mechanical Engineering, Manufacturing Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Strecon A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Mads Clausen Institute (MCI)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hans Nørgaard","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"04ac6d96-df2f-44fb-a89e-7e76b5e460de","name":"Hansen, Hans Nørgaard","orcid":"0000-0001-7829-6962","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Stefania","key":"gasparinpau","last":"Gasparin","locid":"43accc4c-8232-4ae7-8ce2-4e6e49a0006a","name":"Gasparin, Stefania","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rene","key":"sobieckipau","last":"Sobiecki","locid":"61422ae6-8f15-4544-bfc4-4d4aa5669512","name":"Sobiecki, Rene","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"J.","key":"grønbækpau","last":"Grønbæk","name":"Grønbæk, J.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Ruslan","key":"lazarevpau","last":"Lazarev","locid":"4eb7ea38-36f9-4186-a23c-f7b15ac2fd84","name":"Lazarev, Ruslan","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"244-248","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 13. International Conference on Metrology and Properties of Engineering Surfaces"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark","strecon a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-357d8ee4-0643-481a-99e1-f609e910310b","sdu-fc03fb0f-6366-4d0b-bbc2-b8b3f4e1a0ba"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Characterization of ultra-fine surfaces produced by robot assisted polishing","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-089.66-033781","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Aim The primary aim of this study was to identify and describe different delay types in women with gynecologic cancer, and to analyze the relationship between diagnostic delay and a number of characteristics for patients, cancers and the health care system. Setting A cohort study of women newly diagnosed with gynecological cancer at the Department of Gynecology and Obstetrics at Odense University Hospital (OUH) Denmark, during a 15-month period from October 1st 2006 to December 31st 2007. Method Data were obtained from four different questionnaires, the Electronic Patient Journal (EPJ) and The Danish Gynecological Cancer Database (DGCD). 161 women were included; ovarian cancer: 63, endometrial cancer: 50, cervical cancer: 34 and vulvar cancer: 14. Outcome measures were different delay types counted in days and the influence of four clinical important variables: Presence of alarm symptoms, age (≤ or > 60 years), performance of gynecological examination by the GP and notification of cancer suspicion on first referral from GP’s on the diagnostic delay (short delay ≤90 days and long delay >90 days). Results Across cancer type a median total delay of 101 days was observed. The 10% of women with the longest delay experienced a total delay of 436 days or more. Vulva cancer had the longest delays while women with ovarian cancer had shortest delay. Over one third (39%) of the women consulted their GP for reasons other than the alarm symptoms predefined by us. Gynecologic examination by the GP was less likely to be performed if the woman did not present with vaginal bleeding as an alarm symptom. The length of the delay was shortened by performance of a gynecological examination by the GP and a primary referral from the GP raising a cancer suspicion with the receiver. Conclusion Reducing diagnostic delays should be achievable, particularly for those most delayed, named as “the heavy tail”. Interventions aimed at reducing delays especially among the heavy tail need to be developed and creation of new valid instruments for measuring delay are essential to do so.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Vandborg, Mai Partridge","Christensen, René Depont","Kragstrup, Jakob","Edwards, Kasper","Vedsted, Peter","Hansen, Dorte Gilså","Mogensen, Ole"],"cuid":["S04-098.50-015947"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"keyword":["Alarm symptoms","Delay"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"reasons for diagnostic delay in gynecological malignancies","src":["au","dtu","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1097/IGC.0b013e31821d2770","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S04-098.50-015947","identifier":[{"id":"83055178979","type":"scopus"},{"id":"21792008","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-2dee5c91-ba86-411d-adcd-0e21bad2c022","dtu-c5047548-f521-434b-a666-4fbf49c09877","ku-9b6d7d15-f263-4ade-b38b-9e4693d083da","sdu-aaad887a-a81d-4100-8502-b827a6b5508e"],"keyword":["Alarm symptoms","Cancer suspicion","Delay","Gynecological malignancies"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-7-748B51F907E061A368CCEA31F4289D8C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1097/IGC.0b013e31821d2770","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Gynaecology and Obstetrics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Odense University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Public Health, Section of General Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering, Work, Technology and Organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Faculty of Health Sciences, Forskningsenheden for Almen Praksis"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mai Partridge","key":"vandborgpau","last":"Vandborg","locid":"1ecd8cb0-a385-47e3-a2d6-ae2632d00852","name":"P